section

/-!
# Relative simple normal crossing divisors

Let `f : X ⟶ S` be a smooth morphism of schemes of relative dimension `n`. A *relative simple
normal crossing* (*relative snc*) divisor is a reduced effective divisor `D = D₁ + ⋯ + Dₘ` on `X`
that is, locally on `X`, a union of coordinate hyperplanes for relative coordinates: every point
`x ∈ X` has an open neighbourhood `W` with functions `t₁, …, tₙ ∈ 𝒪(W)` whose differentials
`dt₁, …, dtₙ` form a basis of `Ω¹_{W/S}`, such that `D ∩ W = {t₁ ⋯ t_r = 0}`, each `tᵢ` (`i ≤ r`)
is a local equation of a component `D_{j(i)}` through `x`, and distinct `i` give distinct
components. Every intersection of components is then smooth over `S` of the expected relative
dimension. Over `S = Spec k` this is a simple normal crossing divisor on a smooth variety,
`MMP.Mori.DivisorWithCoeffs.IsSNC`.

## Main definitions

* `MMP.Mori.Divisor.IsRelativeSNC`: relative simple normal crossing divisors.

## Implementation notes

The neighbourhood `W` is taken affine, mapping into an affine open `V` of `S`; then
`Ω¹_{W/S}(W)` is the module of Kähler differentials `Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)]`, the algebra structure
being `f.appLE V W`. The divisor is a Weil divisor with all nonzero coefficients equal to `1`
(reduced and effective), whose components are the prime divisors in its support. The equality
`D ∩ W = {t₁ ⋯ t_r = 0}` is read scheme-theoretically: the ideal of the reduced support of `D`
on `W` is generated by `t₁ ⋯ t_r`; together with the local equations `tᵢ` of the components this
makes `D` Cartier. The coordinates `t₁, …, t_r` are the first `r` of the `n` coordinates.

## References

* [J. Kollár, S. Mori, *Birational geometry of algebraic varieties*][KollarMori]
-/

open CategoryTheory AlgebraicGeometry

namespace MMP.Mori.Divisor

/-- A divisor `D` on `X`, for `f : X ⟶ S` smooth of relative dimension `n`, is a *relative simple
normal crossing* divisor if it is reduced and effective (every nonzero coefficient is `1`), and
every point `x ∈ X` lies in an affine open `W`, mapping into an affine open `V` of `S`, with
functions `t₁, …, tₙ ∈ Γ(X, W)` whose differentials form a basis of `Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)]`, and an
injective family `D_{j(1)}, …, D_{j(r)}` of components of `D` through `x` such that `tᵢ`
generates the ideal of `D_{j(i)}` on `W` and `t₁ ⋯ t_r` generates the ideal of the support of
`D` on `W`. -/
@[expose, mmp "def_mmp_relative_snc_divisor"]
public def IsRelativeSNC (n : ℕ) {X S : Scheme.{u}} (f : X ⟶ S) [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (D : Divisor X) : Prop :=
  (∀ E ∈ D.support, D E = 1) ∧
    ∀ x : X, ∃ (W : X.affineOpens) (V : S.affineOpens) (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
      (t : Fin n → Γ(X, W)), x ∈ (W : X.Opens) ∧
      (letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
        ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
          ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i)) ∧
      ∃ (r : ℕ) (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → PrimeDivisor X), Function.Injective j ∧
        (∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ x ∈ (j i).support ∧
          (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)}) ∧
        D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)}

end MMP.Mori.Divisor

end

section

/-!
# Relative logarithmic differential forms

Let `f : X ⟶ S` be smooth of relative dimension `n`, let `D` be a relative simple normal crossing
divisor on `X` (`MMP.Mori.Divisor.IsRelativeSNC`), let `U = X ∖ D` and `j : U ⟶ X` the inclusion.
The sheaf `Ω¹_{X/S}(log D)` is the `𝒪_X`-submodule of `j_*Ω¹_{U/S}` generated by `Ω¹_{X/S}` and
the forms `dt/t`, `t` a local equation of a component of `D`. For `p ≥ 0` the sheaf
`Ω^p_{X/S}(log D) = ⋀^p Ω¹_{X/S}(log D)` is the submodule of `j_*Ω^p_{U/S}` generated by the
`p`-fold wedge products of logarithmic `1`-forms, and
`Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D) = 𝒪_X(-D) · Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` is its twist by the reduced boundary.
Over `S = Spec k` these are `Ω^p_X(log D)` and
`Ω^p_X(log D)(-D)`.

## Main definitions

* `MMP.Mori.Divisor.relativeLogForms`: the sections over an open `W ⊆ X` of
  `I · Ω^p_{X/S}(log D) ⊆ j_*Ω^p_{U/S}`, for an ideal sheaf `I` of `X`. The case `I = ⊤` is
  `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` and the case `I = D.suppIdeal` is `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D)`.

## Implementation notes

The sheaf is described by its sections: a section `ω` of `j_*Ω^p_{U/S}` over `W`, that is, a
section of `Ω^p_{U/S}` over `j⁻¹W`, belongs to it when every point of `W` has an affine
neighbourhood `W' ⊆ W` on which `ω` is a finite sum of products `g · ζ` with `g ∈ I(W')` and
`ζ` in the subring of `⨁_i Γ(j⁻¹W', Ω^i_{U/S})` generated by the functions `g|_U`, the forms
`d(g|_U)` and the forms `(t|_U)⁻¹ d(t|_U)` for `g, t ∈ Γ(X, W')` with `t` generating the ideal of
a component of `D` on `W'`. This is the subsheaf generated by those sections. Because the
generators sit in degrees `0` and `1`, the degree-`p` part of that subring is spanned over
`Γ(X, W')` by the `p`-fold wedges of logarithmic `1`-forms, which is the image of
`⋀^p Ω¹_{X/S}(log D)` in `j_*Ω^p_{U/S}`. The forms `d(g|_U)` are the image of `Ω¹_{X/S}` under the
canonical map `Ω¹_{X/S} → j_*Ω¹_{U/S}`. The reduced boundary `D_red` has ideal `D.suppIdeal`, so
`𝒪_X(-D)` is `D.suppIdeal` for the reduced divisor `D`.

## References

* [J. Kollár, S. Mori, *Birational geometry of algebraic varieties*][KollarMori]
-/

open CategoryTheory AlgebraicGeometry TopologicalSpace Opposite

namespace MMP.Mori.Divisor

/-- The sections over an open `W ⊆ X` of the sheaf `I · Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` of relative logarithmic
`p`-forms twisted by the ideal sheaf `I`, as a subset of the sections over `W` of `j_*Ω^p_{U/S}`,
where `U = X ∖ D` and `j : U ⟶ X`. A section `ω` belongs to it if every point of `W` has an affine
neighbourhood `W' ⊆ W` on which `ω` is a finite sum of products `g · ζ`, `g ∈ I(W')`, with `ζ` in
the subring of the forms on `j⁻¹W'` generated by the functions on `W'`, their differentials and
the forms `dt/t` for `t` a local equation on `W'` of a component of `D`.

`relativeLogForms n f D hD ⊤ p` is `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` and `relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal p`
is `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D)`. -/
@[expose, mmp "def_mmp_relative_log_forms"]
public noncomputable def relativeLogForms (n : ℕ) {X S : Scheme.{u}} (f : X ⟶ S)
    [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f] (D : Divisor X) (_hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f)
    (I : X.IdealSheafData) (p : ℤ) (W : X.Opens) :
    Set (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra
      (Scheme.Opens.ι (D.supp.compl : X.Opens) ≫ f)).piece p).val.obj
        (op (Scheme.Opens.ι (D.supp.compl : X.Opens) ⁻¹ᵁ W))) :=
  let U : X.Opens := D.supp.compl
  let A := Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (U.ι ≫ f)
  let B := A.toPresheafGradedAlgebra
  let d : ∀ V : U.toScheme.Opens, Γ(U.toScheme, V) → (A.piece 1).val.obj (op V) := fun V a =>
    (Scheme.Modules.exteriorGenerator (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials (U.ι ≫ f))).val.app
      (op V) ((Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation (U.ι ≫ f)).d (X := op V) a)
  { ω | ∀ x ∈ W, ∃ (W' : X.affineOpens) (h : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W), x ∈ (W' : X.Opens) ∧
      letI V : U.toScheme.Opens := U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)
      letI res : Γ(X, W') →+* Γ(U.toScheme, V) := (U.ι.app W').hom
      letI gens : Set (B.Total (op V)) :=
        Set.range (fun g : Γ(X, W') => B.structureMap (op V) (res g)) ∪
        Set.range (fun g : Γ(X, W') => B.incl 1 (d V (res g))) ∪
        { η | ∃ E ∈ D.support, ∃ t : Γ(X, W'), E.idealSheaf.ideal W' = Ideal.span {t} ∧
          ∃ s : Γ(U.toScheme, V), s * res t = 1 ∧
            η = B.structureMap (op V) s * B.incl 1 (d V (res t)) }
      B.incl p ((A.piece p).val.map ((Opens.map U.ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op ω) ∈
        AddSubgroup.closure { η | ∃ g ∈ I.ideal W', ∃ ζ ∈ Subring.closure gens,
          η = B.structureMap (op V) (res g) * ζ } }

end MMP.Mori.Divisor

end

section

/-!
# Relative logarithmic forms are locally free and closed under `d`

Let `f : X ⟶ S` be smooth of relative dimension `n`, let `D` be a relative simple normal crossing
divisor on `X` and `U = X ∖ D`. On an affine chart `W` with coordinates `t₁, …, tₙ`, the first
`r` of them local equations of the components of `D` through the chart, the forms
`θᵢ = dtᵢ/tᵢ` (`i < r`) and `θᵢ = dtᵢ` (`i ≥ r`) are a basis of `Ω¹_{X/S}(log D)` on every affine
open `W' ⊆ W`, their wedges `θ_K` a basis of `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)`, and the relative de Rham
differential preserves `Ω^•_{X/S}(log D)` and `Ω^•_{X/S}(log D)(-D)`. This file proves
`MMP.Mori.Divisor.relativeLogForms_free_and_deRhamD_mem`.

The proof runs as follows.

* *The coordinates are étale.* Since the `dtᵢ` are a basis of `Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)]`, the
  Jacobi–Zariski sequence shows that `Γ(S, V)[x₁, …, xₙ] → Γ(X, W)`, `xᵢ ↦ tᵢ`, is étale, hence
  flat; so `h = t₁ ⋯ t_r` is a non-zero-divisor on every affine `W' ⊆ W`. Hence `U ∩ W'` is the
  basic open of `h`: it is affine, and functions on `W'` restrict injectively to it.
* *Independence.* On `U ∩ W'` the `dtᵢ` are a basis of the Kähler differentials (an open
  immersion is formally étale), and on an affine open the sections of `Ω^p` are the `p`-th
  exterior power of those of `Ω¹`, so the wedges `dt_K` are independent; the `θ_K` differ from
  them by units.
* *Generation.* A function's differential is a combination of the `dtᵢ` with regular
  coefficients. If `t` is a local equation of a component of `D` on an affine open `W₁ ⊆ W`, then
  either that component is a coordinate component, `t = u tᵢ` and `dt/t = du/u + dtᵢ/tᵢ`, or its
  generic point is not in `W₁` and `t` is a unit there. Products of the `θ_K` are `0` or `±θ_K`,
  since the `θᵢ` anticommute and square to zero.
* *Gluing.* The local expressions of a logarithmic form agree on overlaps by independence, so
  they glue, and membership of the coefficients in an ideal sheaf is local.
* *The differential.* The de Rham rule `d(b · dc₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ dc_p) = db ∧ dc₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ dc_p` and the
  Leibniz rule give the closure of the logarithmic forms under `d`; `d(1/t) ∧ dt = 0` takes care
  of the forms `dt/t`. For the twist, `h = t₁ ⋯ t_r` cuts out the support of `D` near each point,
  `d(ha) = h · (a · dh/h + da)` and `dh/h = ∑ dtᵢ/tᵢ`.

## Main results

* `MMP.Mori.Divisor.relativeLogForms_free_and_deRhamD_mem`: the statement above.

## Implementation notes

Forms of all degrees are compared in the total ring of `Ω^•_{U/S}`, which is graded commutative;
the functions act through its structure map, whose image is central. The structure map on
functions, the exact one-forms `d a` and the products `b · dc₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ dc_p` are packaged as
definitions so that the algebra in the total ring is carried out on them directly.

## References

* [J. Kollár, S. Mori, *Birational geometry of algebraic varieties*][KollarMori]
-/

open CategoryTheory AlgebraicGeometry TopologicalSpace Opposite MMP.Mori.Divisor
open MMP.Mori (Divisor)

namespace MMP.Mori.Divisor.MmpRelativeLogFormsBasisProof

/-! ### Products of anticommuting square-zero elements -/

section AntiComm

variable {T : Type*} [Ring T] {ι : Type*} (θ : ι → T)

/-- Permuting the factors of a product of pairwise anticommuting elements changes it at most
by a sign. -/
private theorem prod_map_perm (hac : ∀ i j, θ i * θ j = -(θ j * θ i)) {l₁ l₂ : List ι}
    (h : l₁.Perm l₂) :
    (l₁.map θ).prod = (l₂.map θ).prod ∨ (l₁.map θ).prod = -(l₂.map θ).prod := by
  induction h with
  | nil => exact Or.inl rfl
  | cons x _ ih =>
    rcases ih with ih | ih
    · exact Or.inl (by simp [ih])
    · exact Or.inr (by simp [ih])
  | swap x y l =>
    right
    simp only [List.map_cons, List.prod_cons, ← mul_assoc, hac y x, neg_mul]
  | trans _ _ ih₁ ih₂ =>
    rcases ih₁ with h₁ | h₁ <;> rcases ih₂ with h₂ | h₂
    · exact Or.inl (h₁.trans h₂)
    · exact Or.inr (h₁.trans h₂)
    · exact Or.inr (by rw [h₁, h₂])
    · exact Or.inl (by rw [h₁, h₂, neg_neg])

/-- A product of pairwise anticommuting square-zero elements with a repeated factor vanishes. -/
private theorem prod_map_eq_zero_of_not_nodup (hsq : ∀ i, θ i * θ i = 0)
    (hac : ∀ i j, θ i * θ j = -(θ j * θ i)) {l : List ι} (h : ¬ l.Nodup) :
    (l.map θ).prod = 0 := by
  classical
  rw [List.nodup_iff_count_le_one] at h
  simp only [not_forall, not_le] at h
  obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ := h
  have ha1 : a ∈ l := List.count_pos_iff.mp (by omega)
  have ha2 : a ∈ l.erase a := by
    rw [← List.count_pos_iff, List.count_erase_self]; omega
  have hp : l.Perm (a :: a :: (l.erase a).erase a) :=
    (List.perm_cons_erase ha1).trans (List.Perm.cons a (List.perm_cons_erase ha2))
  rcases prod_map_perm θ hac hp with e | e <;>
    simp [e, ← mul_assoc, hsq a]

/-- The product of the elements indexed by two finite sets, each in increasing order, is up to
sign the product indexed by their union when they are disjoint, and vanishes otherwise. -/
private theorem prod_sort_mul_prod_sort [LinearOrder ι] (hsq : ∀ i, θ i * θ i = 0)
    (hac : ∀ i j, θ i * θ j = -(θ j * θ i)) (K L : Finset ι) :
    ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod * ((L.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod = 0 ∨
      ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod * ((L.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod =
        (((K ∪ L).sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod ∨
      ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod * ((L.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod =
        -(((K ∪ L).sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ).prod := by
  rw [← List.prod_append, ← List.map_append]
  by_cases hnd : (K.sort (· ≤ ·) ++ L.sort (· ≤ ·)).Nodup
  · right
    refine prod_map_perm θ hac (List.perm_of_nodup_nodup_toFinset_eq hnd
      (Finset.sort_nodup _ _) ?_)
    ext x
    simp
  · exact Or.inl (prod_map_eq_zero_of_not_nodup θ hsq hac hnd)

end AntiComm

/-! ### Coordinates of a smooth algebra are non-zero-divisors -/

section Coordinates

/-- **Étale coordinates.** If `B` is smooth over `R` and the differentials of `t₁, …, tₙ` form a
basis of `Ω[B⁄R]`, then `R[x₁, …, xₙ] → B`, `xᵢ ↦ tᵢ`, is étale; in particular each `tᵢ` is a
non-zero-divisor of `B`. -/
private theorem isSMulRegular_of_basis_D {R B : Type u} [CommRing R] [CommRing B] [Algebra R B]
    [Algebra.Smooth R B] {n : ℕ} (t : Fin n → B) (b : Module.Basis (Fin n) B Ω[B⁄R])
    (hb : ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D R B (t i)) (i : Fin n) : IsSMulRegular B (t i) := by
  let P := MvPolynomial (Fin n) R
  let _ : Algebra P B := (MvPolynomial.aeval t).toRingHom.toAlgebra
  have : IsScalarTower R P B := IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun r => by
    simp [RingHom.algebraMap_toAlgebra, P]
  have hX : ∀ i, algebraMap P B (MvPolynomial.X i) = t i := fun i => by
    simp [RingHom.algebraMap_toAlgebra, P]
  let bP := (KaehlerDifferential.mvPolynomialBasis R (Fin n)).baseChange B
  have hmap :
      KaehlerDifferential.mapBaseChange R P B = (bP.equiv b (Equiv.refl _)).toLinearMap := by
    refine bP.ext fun i => ?_
    rw [LinearEquiv.coe_coe, Module.Basis.equiv_apply, Equiv.refl_apply, hb]
    simp only [bP, Module.Basis.baseChange_apply, KaehlerDifferential.mvPolynomialBasis_apply]
    rw [KaehlerDifferential.mapBaseChange_tmul, one_smul, KaehlerDifferential.map_D, hX]
  have hbij : Function.Bijective (KaehlerDifferential.mapBaseChange R P B) := by
    rw [hmap]; exact (bP.equiv b (Equiv.refl _)).bijective
  have : Subsingleton Ω[B⁄P] := subsingleton_of_forall_eq 0 fun z => by
    obtain ⟨w, rfl⟩ := KaehlerDifferential.map_surjective R P B z
    exact (KaehlerDifferential.exact_mapBaseChange_map R P B w).mpr (hbij.2 w)
  have : Subsingleton (Algebra.H1Cotangent P B) := subsingleton_of_forall_eq 0 fun z => by
    have hδ : Algebra.H1Cotangent.δ R P B z = 0 :=
      hbij.1 ((Algebra.H1Cotangent.exact_δ_mapBaseChange R P B _).mpr ⟨z, rfl⟩ |>.trans
        (map_zero _).symm)
    obtain ⟨w, rfl⟩ := (Algebra.H1Cotangent.exact_map_δ R P B z).mp hδ
    rw [Subsingleton.elim w 0, map_zero]
  have : Algebra.FormallyEtale P B :=
    (Algebra.formallyEtale_iff P B).mpr ⟨inferInstance, inferInstance⟩
  have : Algebra.FinitePresentation P B :=
    Algebra.FinitePresentation.of_restrict_scalars_finitePresentation R P B
  have : Algebra.Etale P B := ⟨inferInstance, inferInstance⟩
  rw [← hX]
  exact IsSMulRegular.of_flat (MvPolynomial.isRegular_X.left)

/-- A basis of exact differentials transfers along a formally étale ring map. -/
private theorem exists_basis_D_of_comp {R A C : Type u} [CommRing R] [CommRing A] [CommRing C]
    (α : R →+* A) (β : A →+* C) (γ : R →+* C) (hγ : γ = β.comp α)
    (hβ : letI := β.toAlgebra; Algebra.FormallyEtale A C) {n : ℕ} (t : Fin n → A)
    (hb : letI := α.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) A Ω[A⁄R], ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D R A (t i)) :
    letI := γ.toAlgebra
    ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) C Ω[C⁄R], ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D R C (β (t i)) := by
  let _ := α.toAlgebra
  let _ := β.toAlgebra
  let _ := γ.toAlgebra
  have : IsScalarTower R A C := IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun r => by
    simp [RingHom.algebraMap_toAlgebra, hγ]
  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := hb
  refine ⟨(KaehlerDifferential.isBaseChange_of_formallyEtale R A C).basis b, fun i => ?_⟩
  rw [IsBaseChange.basis_apply, hb, KaehlerDifferential.map_D]
  rfl

end Coordinates

/-! ### The total ring of relative differential forms -/

section Forms

variable {Y S : Scheme.{u}} (g : Y ⟶ S)

/-- The graded algebra of relative differential forms of `g`, as a presheaf graded algebra. -/
private noncomputable abbrev TB :=
  (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).toPresheafGradedAlgebra

/-- The structure map `𝒪_Y(O) → Ω^•_{Y/S}(O)`. -/
private noncomputable def sm (O : Y.Opens) : Γ(Y, O) →+* (TB g).Total (op O) :=
  (TB g).structureMap (op O)

/-- A section of `Ω_{Y/S}`, read as a degree-one element of the total ring of forms. -/
private noncomputable def ι1 (O : Y.Opens)
    (ξ : (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) : (TB g).Total (op O) :=
  (TB g).incl 1
    ((Scheme.Modules.exteriorGenerator (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g)).val.app (op O) ξ)

/-- The exact one-form `d a`, as a degree-one element of the total ring of forms. -/
private noncomputable def δ (O : Y.Opens) (a : Γ(Y, O)) : (TB g).Total (op O) :=
  ι1 g O ((Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation g).d (X := op O) a)

variable {g}

private theorem sm_comm {O : Y.Opens} (c : Γ(Y, O)) (z : (TB g).Total (op O)) :
    sm g O c * z = z * sm g O c :=
  (TB g).structureMap_commutes _ c z

private theorem smul_eq_sm_mul {O : Y.Opens}
    (c : (Stacks.RingedSpace.structureRingSheaf Y.toRingedSpace).obj.obj (op O))
    (z : (TB g).Total (op O)) :
    c • z = sm g O c * z := by
  change _ = c • (1 : (TB g).Total (op O)) * z
  rw [(TB g).smul_mul_eq, one_mul]

private theorem sm_mul_incl {O : Y.Opens}
    (c : (Stacks.RingedSpace.structureRingSheaf Y.toRingedSpace).obj.obj (op O)) (p : ℤ)
    (x : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.obj (op O)) :
    sm g O c * (TB g).incl p x = (TB g).incl p (c • x) :=
  ((smul_eq_sm_mul c _).symm.trans ((TB g).incl_smul p c x).symm)

private theorem ι1_add {O : Y.Opens} (ξ η : (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) :
    ι1 g O (ξ + η) = ι1 g O ξ + ι1 g O η :=
  (congrArg ((TB g).incl 1) (map_add _ ξ η)).trans ((TB g).incl_add 1 _ _)

private theorem ι1_smul {O : Y.Opens} (c : Y.ringCatSheaf.obj.obj (op O))
    (ξ : (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) :
    ι1 g O (c • ξ) = sm g O c * ι1 g O ξ :=
  (congrArg ((TB g).incl 1)
    (((Scheme.Modules.exteriorGenerator (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g)).val.app
      (op O)).hom.map_smul c ξ)).trans
    (sm_mul_incl (g := g)
      (show (Stacks.RingedSpace.structureRingSheaf Y.toRingedSpace).obj.obj (op O) from c) 1
      _).symm

private theorem ι1_mul_self {O : Y.Opens}
    (ξ : (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) :
    ι1 g O ξ * ι1 g O ξ = 0 := by
  have h := (Scheme.Modules.isExteriorAlgebra_exteriorAlgebra
    (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g)).1 (op O) ξ
  refine ((TB g).incl_mul_incl 1 1 _ _).trans ?_
  refine (congrArg ((TB g).incl (1 + 1)) h).trans ?_
  exact (TB g).incl_zero _

private theorem ι1_anticomm {O : Y.Opens}
    (ξ η : (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) :
    ι1 g O ξ * ι1 g O η = -(ι1 g O η * ι1 g O ξ) := by
  have h := ι1_mul_self (g := g) (ξ + η)
  rw [ι1_add, add_mul, mul_add, mul_add, ι1_mul_self, ι1_mul_self, zero_add, add_zero] at h
  exact eq_neg_of_add_eq_zero_left h

private theorem δ_mul {O : Y.Opens} (a b : Γ(Y, O)) :
    δ g O (a * b) = sm g O a * δ g O b + sm g O b * δ g O a := by
  refine (congrArg (ι1 g O)
    ((Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation g).d_mul (X := op O) a b)).trans ?_
  refine (ι1_add _ _).trans ?_
  exact congrArg₂ (· + ·) (ι1_smul _ _) (ι1_smul _ _)

private theorem δ_one {O : Y.Opens} : δ g O 1 = 0 := by
  refine (congrArg (ι1 g O) ((Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation g).d_one (op O))).trans ?_
  refine (congrArg ((TB g).incl 1) (map_zero _)).trans ?_
  exact (TB g).incl_zero _

private theorem δ_anticomm {O : Y.Opens} (a b : Γ(Y, O)) :
    δ g O a * δ g O b = -(δ g O b * δ g O a) :=
  ι1_anticomm _ _

private theorem δ_mul_self {O : Y.Opens} (a : Γ(Y, O)) : δ g O a * δ g O a = 0 :=
  ι1_mul_self _

private theorem totalRestrict_ι1 {O O' : Y.Opens} (φ : op O ⟶ op O')
    (ξ : (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) :
    (TB g).totalRestrict φ (ι1 g O ξ) =
      ι1 g O' ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.map φ ξ) :=
  ((TB g).totalRestrict_incl _ 1 _).trans (congrArg ((TB g).incl 1)
    (PresheafOfModules.naturality_apply
      (Scheme.Modules.exteriorGenerator (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g)).val φ ξ).symm)

private theorem totalRestrict_δ {O O' : Y.Opens} (φ : op O ⟶ op O') (a : Γ(Y, O)) :
    (TB g).totalRestrict φ (δ g O a) = δ g O' (Y.presheaf.map φ a) :=
  (totalRestrict_ι1 φ _).trans (congrArg (ι1 g O')
    ((Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation g).d_map φ a).symm)

private theorem totalRestrict_sm {O O' : Y.Opens} (φ : op O ⟶ op O') (c : Γ(Y, O)) :
    (TB g).totalRestrict φ (sm g O c) = sm g O' (Y.presheaf.map φ c) :=
  (TB g).structureMap_naturality _ c

/-- A function times a wedge of exact one-forms, `b · d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ`. -/
private noncomputable def mon (g : Y ⟶ S) (O : Y.Opens) (b : Γ(Y, O)) (l : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    (TB g).Total (op O) :=
  sm g O b * (l.map (δ g O)).prod

/-- The differential of `b · d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ`, namely `d b ∧ d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ`. -/
private noncomputable def dmon (g : Y ⟶ S) (O : Y.Opens) (b : Γ(Y, O)) (l : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    (TB g).Total (op O) :=
  δ g O b * (l.map (δ g O)).prod

/-- **The de Rham rule in the total ring.** `b · d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ` is homogeneous of degree `p`, and
the de Rham differential carries it to `d b ∧ d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ`. -/
private theorem exists_incl_eq_mon (O : Y.Opens) (b : Γ(Y, O)) (l : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    ∃ x : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece (l.length : ℤ)).val.obj (op O),
      (TB g).incl (l.length : ℤ) x = mon g O b l ∧
      (TB g).incl ((l.length + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)
          (((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex g).d l.length (l.length + 1)).val.app (op O) x) =
        dmon g O b l := by
  set p := l.length
  let c : Fin (p + 1) → Y.sheaf.obj.obj (op O) := Fin.cons b l.get
  let w := (TB g).homogeneousProdLeft (op O) p fun i =>
    SheafOfModules.exactOne (Scheme.Hom.deRhamAlgebras g) (op O) (c i.succ)
  refine ⟨c 0 • w, ?_, ?_⟩
  · refine ((sm_mul_incl (g := g) b _ w).symm).trans ?_
    refine congrArg (sm g O b * ·) ?_
    refine ((TB g).incl_homogeneousProdLeft (op O) p _).trans ?_
    rw [← List.ofFn_get l, List.map_ofFn]
    rfl
  · have h := Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex_d_homogeneousProdLeft g (op O) p c
    refine (congrArg ((TB g).incl ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)) h).trans ?_
    refine ((TB g).incl_homogeneousProdLeft (op O) (p + 1) _).trans ?_
    rw [List.ofFn_succ, List.prod_cons]
    refine congrArg (δ g O b * ·) ?_
    rw [← List.ofFn_get l, List.map_ofFn]
    rfl

private theorem δ_mul_list_prod {O : Y.Opens} (c : Γ(Y, O)) (l : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    δ g O c * (l.map (δ g O)).prod = (-1) ^ l.length * ((l.map (δ g O)).prod * δ g O c) := by
  induction l with
  | nil => simp
  | cons a l ih =>
    simp only [List.map_cons, List.prod_cons, List.length_cons, pow_succ]
    rw [← mul_assoc, δ_anticomm, neg_mul, mul_assoc, ih]
    simp only [mul_neg, neg_mul, mul_one, mul_assoc]
    rw [← mul_assoc (δ g O a), ← ((Commute.neg_one_left (δ g O a)).pow_left l.length).eq,
      mul_assoc]

private theorem mon_mul {O : Y.Opens} (b b' : Γ(Y, O)) (l l' : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    mon g O b l * mon g O b' l' = mon g O (b * b') (l ++ l') := by
  simp only [mon, List.map_append, List.prod_append, map_mul]
  rw [mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc _ (sm g O b'), ← sm_comm, mul_assoc, mul_assoc]

private theorem dmon_mul {O : Y.Opens} (b b' : Γ(Y, O)) (l l' : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    dmon g O (b * b') (l ++ l') =
      dmon g O b l * mon g O b' l' + (-1) ^ l.length * (mon g O b l * dmon g O b' l') := by
  have e1 : δ g O b * (l.map (δ g O)).prod * (sm g O b' * (l'.map (δ g O)).prod) =
      sm g O b' * δ g O b * ((l.map (δ g O)).prod * (l'.map (δ g O)).prod) := by
    rw [mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc (l.map (δ g O)).prod, ← sm_comm, mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc,
      ← sm_comm]
  have e2 : sm g O b * δ g O b' * ((l.map (δ g O)).prod * (l'.map (δ g O)).prod) =
      (-1) ^ l.length * (sm g O b * (l.map (δ g O)).prod * (δ g O b' *
      (l'.map (δ g O)).prod)) := by
    rw [mul_assoc (sm g O b), ← mul_assoc (δ g O b') (l.map (δ g O)).prod,
      δ_mul_list_prod b' l]
    simp only [mul_assoc]
    rw [← mul_assoc (sm g O b), ← ((Commute.neg_one_left (sm g O b)).pow_left l.length).eq,
      mul_assoc]
  simp only [dmon, mon, δ_mul, List.map_append, List.prod_append, add_mul]
  rw [e1, ← e2, add_comm]

private theorem proj_incl_of_ne {O : Y.Opens} {i j : ℤ} (h : j ≠ i)
    (x : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece j).val.obj (op O)) :
    (TB g).proj (op O) i ((TB g).incl j x) = 0 :=
  DirectSum.of_eq_of_ne _ _ _ h.symm

/-- The de Rham differential in degree `p`, applied to the degree-`p` component of an element of
the total ring and read back in the total ring. -/
private noncomputable def Δ (g : Y ⟶ S) (O : Y.Opens) (p : ℕ) :
    (TB g).Total (op O) →+ (TB g).Total (op O) where
  toFun z := (TB g).incl ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)
    (((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex g).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op O) ((TB g).proj (op O) p z))
  map_zero' := by
    rw [map_zero]
    exact (congrArg ((TB g).incl _) (map_zero _)).trans ((TB g).incl_zero _)
  map_add' z z' := by
    rw [map_add]
    exact (congrArg ((TB g).incl _) (map_add _ _ _)).trans ((TB g).incl_add _ _ _)

private theorem Δ_incl {O : Y.Opens} (p : ℕ)
    (x : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece (p : ℤ)).val.obj (op O)) :
    Δ g O p ((TB g).incl (p : ℤ) x) = (TB g).incl ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)
      (((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex g).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op O) x) := by
  change (TB g).incl _ (((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex g).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op O)
    ((TB g).proj (op O) p ((TB g).incl (p : ℤ) x))) = _
  rw [(TB g).proj_incl]

private theorem Δ_mon {O : Y.Opens} (p : ℕ) (b : Γ(Y, O)) (l : List Γ(Y, O)) :
    Δ g O p (mon g O b l) = if l.length = p then dmon g O b l else 0 := by
  obtain ⟨x, hx, hdx⟩ := exists_incl_eq_mon (g := g) O b l
  rw [← hx]
  split_ifs with h
  · subst h
    rw [Δ_incl, hdx]
  · change (TB g).incl _ (((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex g).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op O)
      ((TB g).proj (op O) p ((TB g).incl (l.length : ℤ) x))) = 0
    rw [proj_incl_of_ne (by exact_mod_cast h)]
    exact (congrArg ((TB g).incl _) (map_zero _)).trans ((TB g).incl_zero _)

/-- **The differential preserves the forms generated by functions, exact forms and forms
`b · d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ` whose differential they contain.** Let `G` be a set of products
`b · d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ` whose differentials `d b ∧ d c₁ ∧ ⋯ ∧ d cₚ` lie in the ring generated by `G`,
and let `J` be a set of functions whose differentials are multiples of elements of `J` by
elements of that ring. Then the de Rham differential maps the `J`-multiples of the ring
generated by `G` to themselves, degree by degree. -/
private theorem Δ_mem_closure {O : Y.Opens} (G : Set ((TB g).Total (op O)))
    (hG : ∀ z ∈ G, ∃ b l, z = mon g O b l ∧ dmon g O b l ∈ Subring.closure G)
    {A : Type*} (ρ : A → Γ(Y, O)) (J : Set A)
    (hJ : ∀ c ∈ J, ∃ c₀ ∈ J, ∃ ω ∈ Subring.closure G, δ g O (ρ c) = sm g O (ρ c₀) * ω)
    (p : ℕ) {z : (TB g).Total (op O)}
    (hz : z ∈ AddSubgroup.closure
      {η | ∃ c ∈ J, ∃ ζ ∈ Subring.closure G, η = sm g O (ρ c) * ζ}) :
    Δ g O p z ∈ AddSubgroup.closure
      {η | ∃ c ∈ J, ∃ ζ ∈ Subring.closure G, η = sm g O (ρ c) * ζ} := by
  set R₀ := Subring.closure G
  set Z := AddSubgroup.closure {η | ∃ c ∈ J, ∃ ζ ∈ R₀, η = sm g O (ρ c) * ζ}
  let M : Submonoid ((TB g).Total (op O)) :=
    { carrier := {z | ∃ b l, z = mon g O b l ∧ mon g O b l ∈ R₀ ∧ dmon g O b l ∈ R₀}
      one_mem' := ⟨1, [], by simp [mon], by simp [mon, R₀.one_mem],
        by simp [dmon, δ_one, R₀.zero_mem]⟩
      mul_mem' := by
        rintro _ _ ⟨b, l, rfl, hm, hd⟩ ⟨b', l', rfl, hm', hd'⟩
        refine ⟨b * b', l ++ l', mon_mul b b' l l', ?_, ?_⟩
        · rw [← mon_mul]; exact R₀.mul_mem hm hm'
        · rw [dmon_mul]
          exact R₀.add_mem (R₀.mul_mem hd hm') (R₀.mul_mem (R₀.pow_mem (R₀.neg_mem R₀.one_mem) _)
            (R₀.mul_mem hm hd')) }
  have hGM : Submonoid.closure G ≤ M := by
    refine Submonoid.closure_le.mpr fun z hz => ?_
    obtain ⟨b, l, rfl, hd⟩ := hG z hz
    exact ⟨b, l, rfl, Subring.subset_closure hz, hd⟩
  have hR₀ : ∀ ζ ∈ R₀, ζ ∈ AddSubgroup.closure (M : Set ((TB g).Total (op O))) := fun ζ hζ =>
    AddSubgroup.closure_mono hGM (Subring.mem_closure_iff.mp hζ)
  have hgen : ∀ c ∈ J, ∀ ζ ∈ R₀, Δ g O p (sm g O (ρ c) * ζ) ∈ Z := by
    intro c hc ζ hζ
    obtain ⟨c₀, hc₀, ω, hω, hδc⟩ := hJ c hc
    have hζ' := hR₀ ζ hζ
    clear hζ
    induction hζ' using AddSubgroup.closure_induction with
    | mem z hz =>
      obtain ⟨b, l, rfl, hm, hd⟩ := hz
      have e : sm g O (ρ c) * mon g O b l = mon g O (ρ c * b) l := by
        simp only [mon, map_mul, mul_assoc]
      rw [e, Δ_mon]
      split_ifs
      · have e2 : dmon g O (ρ c * b) l =
            sm g O (ρ c) * dmon g O b l + sm g O (ρ c₀) * (ω * mon g O b l) := by
          simp only [dmon, mon, δ_mul, add_mul, hδc]
          rw [show sm g O b * (sm g O (ρ c₀) * ω) = sm g O (ρ c₀) * (ω * sm g O b) by
            rw [← mul_assoc, sm_comm (c := b) (sm g O (ρ c₀)), mul_assoc, sm_comm (c := b) ω]]
          simp only [mul_assoc]
        rw [e2]
        exact Z.add_mem (AddSubgroup.subset_closure ⟨c, hc, _, hd, rfl⟩)
          (AddSubgroup.subset_closure ⟨c₀, hc₀, _, R₀.mul_mem hω hm, rfl⟩)
      · exact Z.zero_mem
    | zero => rw [mul_zero, map_zero]; exact Z.zero_mem
    | add z z' _ _ hz hz' => rw [mul_add, map_add]; exact Z.add_mem hz hz'
    | neg z _ hz => rw [mul_neg, map_neg]; exact Z.neg_mem hz
  induction hz using AddSubgroup.closure_induction with
  | mem z hz =>
    obtain ⟨c, hc, ζ, hζ, rfl⟩ := hz
    exact hgen c hc ζ hζ
  | zero => rw [map_zero]; exact Z.zero_mem
  | add z z' _ _ hz hz' => rw [map_add]; exact Z.add_mem hz hz'
  | neg z _ hz => rw [map_neg]; exact Z.neg_mem hz

private theorem δ_mul_δ_of_mul_eq_one {O : Y.Opens} {s t : Γ(Y, O)} (h : s * t = 1) :
    δ g O s * δ g O t = 0 := by
  have h1 : sm g O t * δ g O s = -(sm g O s * δ g O t) := by
    refine eq_neg_of_add_eq_zero_right ?_
    rw [← δ_mul, h, δ_one]
  calc δ g O s * δ g O t = sm g O (s * t) * (δ g O s * δ g O t) := by rw [h, map_one, one_mul]
    _ = sm g O s * ((sm g O t * δ g O s) * δ g O t) := by rw [map_mul, mul_assoc, mul_assoc]
    _ = 0 := by rw [h1, neg_mul, mul_assoc, δ_mul_self, mul_zero, neg_zero, mul_zero]

/-- **The logarithmic derivative of a product.** If each `aᵢ` has an inverse `sᵢ`, then
`d(∏ aᵢ) = (∏ aᵢ) · ∑ sᵢ daᵢ`. -/
private theorem δ_prod_eq {O : Y.Opens} {r : ℕ} (a s : Fin r → Γ(Y, O)) (hs : ∀ i, s i * a i = 1) :
    δ g O (∏ i, a i) = sm g O (∏ i, a i) * ∑ i, sm g O (s i) * δ g O (a i) := by
  induction r with
  | zero => simp [δ_one]
  | succ r ih =>
    set P := ∏ i : Fin r, a i.succ
    have e2 : sm g O P * δ g O (a 0) = sm g O (a 0) * sm g O P * (sm g O (s 0) * δ g O (a 0)) := by
      rw [← mul_assoc, ← map_mul, ← map_mul,
        show a 0 * P * s 0 = P by rw [mul_comm (a 0), mul_assoc, mul_comm (a 0), hs 0, mul_one]]
    rw [Fin.prod_univ_succ, Fin.sum_univ_succ, δ_mul, ih (fun i => a i.succ) (fun i => s i.succ)
      (fun i => hs i.succ), map_mul, mul_add, ← mul_assoc (sm g O (a 0)), e2, add_comm]

private theorem incl_sum {O : Y.Opens} (p : ℤ) {ι : Type*} (s : Finset ι)
    (x : ι → ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.obj (op O)) :
    (TB g).incl p (∑ i ∈ s, x i) = ∑ i ∈ s, (TB g).incl p (x i) := by
  classical
  induction s using Finset.induction_on with
  | empty => exact (TB g).incl_zero p
  | insert a s ha ih =>
    rw [Finset.sum_insert ha, Finset.sum_insert ha, ← ih]
    exact (TB g).incl_add p _ _

private theorem ι1_sum {O : Y.Opens} {ι : Type*} (s : Finset ι)
    (ξ : ι → (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g).val.obj (op O)) :
    ι1 g O (∑ i ∈ s, ξ i) = ∑ i ∈ s, ι1 g O (ξ i) := by
  classical
  induction s using Finset.induction_on with
  | empty =>
    exact (congrArg ((TB g).incl 1) (map_zero _)).trans ((TB g).incl_zero _)
  | insert a s ha ih =>
    rw [Finset.sum_insert ha, Finset.sum_insert ha, ι1_add, ih]

private theorem prod_map_sm_mul {O : Y.Opens} {ι : Type*} (σ : ι → Γ(Y, O))
    (x : ι → (TB g).Total (op O)) (l : List ι) :
    (l.map fun i => sm g O (σ i) * x i).prod = sm g O (l.map σ).prod * (l.map x).prod := by
  induction l with
  | nil => simp
  | cons a l ih =>
    simp only [List.map_cons, List.prod_cons, ih, map_mul]
    rw [mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc (x a), ← sm_comm, mul_assoc, mul_assoc]

/-- **Wedges of a basis of exact forms are independent.** On an affine open `O` of `Y`, over an
affine open of `S`, if `dτ₁, …, dτₙ` is a basis of the Kähler differentials, then the wedges
`dτ_K`, `K` a `p`-element subset, are linearly independent over `Γ(Y, O)` in the total ring of
forms. -/
private theorem eq_zero_of_sum_sm_mul_prod_eq_zero {O : Y.Opens} (hO : IsAffineOpen O)
    {V : S.Opens} (hV : IsAffineOpen V) (e : O ≤ g ⁻¹ᵁ V) {n : ℕ} (τ : Fin n → Γ(Y, O))
    (hb : letI := (g.appLE V O e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(Y, O) Ω[Γ(Y, O)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(Y, O) (τ i))
    (p : ℕ) (a : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(Y, O))
    (ha : ∑ K, sm g O (a K) * ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map fun i => δ g O (τ i)).prod = 0) :
    a = 0 := by
  let _ := (g.appLE V O e).hom.toAlgebra
  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := hb
  have := Scheme.Hom.isQuasicoherent_relativeDifferentials g
  let kE := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.AffineOpenDeRham.kaehlerSectionsEquiv g hO hV e
  let b₁ := b.map kE
  have hb₁ : ∀ i, b₁ i = (Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation g).d (X := op O) (τ i) :=
    fun i => (congrArg kE (hb i)).trans
      (Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.AffineDifferentials.kaehlerToSections_d g V O e (τ i))
  let iso := Stacks.AffineExteriorPower.affineOpenExteriorPowerΓIso
    (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g) hO
    (Scheme.Modules.isExteriorAlgebra_exteriorAlgebra (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g)) p
  let z : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} →
      ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece (p : ℤ)).val.obj (op O) :=
    fun K => (TB g).homogeneousProd (op O) p fun k =>
      (Scheme.Modules.exteriorGenerator (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials g)).val.app (op O)
        (b₁ (K.1.orderEmbOfFin K.2 k))
  have hz : ∀ K, (TB g).incl (p : ℤ) (z K) =
      ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map fun i => δ g O (τ i)).prod := fun K => by
    refine ((TB g).incl_homogeneousProd (op O) p _).trans ?_
    rw [← List.ofFn_eq_map.trans (K.1.listMap_orderEmbOfFin_finRange K.2), List.map_ofFn]
    exact congrArg (fun F => (List.ofFn F).prod) (funext fun k => congrArg (ι1 g O) (hb₁ _))
  have hiso : ∀ K, iso.hom.hom (z K) = exteriorPower.ιMulti_family Γ(Y, O) p b₁ K := fun K =>
    Stacks.AffineExteriorPower.affineOpenExteriorPowerΓIso_hom_homogeneousProd _ hO _ p _
  let a' : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} →
      (Stacks.RingedSpace.structureRingSheaf Y.toRingedSpace).obj.obj (op O) := a
  have hsum : ∑ K, a' K • z K = 0 := by
    refine (TB g).incl_inj_of_proj ?_
    rw [(TB g).incl_zero, ← ha]
    simp only [← hz]
    rw [incl_sum]
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => (sm_mul_incl (a K) _ (z K)).symm
  have hsum' : ∑ K : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p},
      a K • exteriorPower.ιMulti_family Γ(Y, O) p b₁ K = 0 := by
    have h1 := congrArg iso.hom.hom hsum
    have h2 : iso.hom.hom (∑ K, a' K • z K) = ∑ K, a K • iso.hom.hom (z K) :=
      (map_sum iso.hom.hom _ _).trans (Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => iso.hom.hom.map_smul _ _)
    have h3 : ∑ K, a K • iso.hom.hom (z K) = 0 := h2.symm.trans (h1.trans (map_zero _))
    refine Eq.trans ?_ h3
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => by rw [hiso]
  have hli := exteriorPower.ιMulti_family_linearIndependent_ofBasis Γ(Y, O) p b₁
  funext K
  exact linearIndependent_iff'.mp hli (Finset.univ : Finset {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p})
    a hsum' K (Finset.mem_univ K)

/-- Sections of a sheaf of forms agreeing on the members of an open cover are equal. -/
private theorem piece_ext (p : ℤ) {O : Y.Opens} {ι : Type*} (Ox : ι → Y.Opens) (ix : ∀ i, Ox i ⟶ O)
    (hcov : O ≤ iSup Ox)
    (x y : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.obj (op O))
    (h : ∀ i, ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.map (ix i).op x =
      ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.map (ix i).op y) :
    x = y := by
  let Sv : Sieve O :=
    { arrows := fun V _ => ∃ i, V ≤ Ox i
      downward_closed := fun {_ _} {_} hi g => by
        obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := hi
        exact ⟨i, (leOfHom g).trans hi⟩ }
  have hS : Sv ∈ Opens.grothendieckTopology Y O := by
    intro z hz
    obtain ⟨i, hi⟩ := TopologicalSpace.Opens.mem_iSup.mp (hcov hz)
    exact ⟨Ox i, ix i, ⟨i, le_rfl⟩, hi⟩
  refine ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).isSheaf.isSeparated O Sv hS
    x y fun V φ ⟨i, hi⟩ => ?_
  have hφ : φ = homOfLE hi ≫ ix i := Subsingleton.elim _ _
  subst hφ
  change ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.map
      ((ix i).op ≫ (homOfLE hi).op) x =
    ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra g).piece p).val.map
      ((ix i).op ≫ (homOfLE hi).op) y
  rw [PresheafOfModules.map_comp_apply, PresheafOfModules.map_comp_apply, h i]

end Forms

/-! ### Logarithmic forms on the complement of a divisor -/

section Log

variable {X S : Scheme.{u}} (f : X ⟶ S) (D : MMP.Mori.Divisor X)

/-- The complement `U = X ∖ D` of the support of a divisor. -/
private abbrev Uc : X.Opens := D.supp.compl

/-- The morphism `U ⟶ S`. -/
private abbrev gU : (Uc D).toScheme ⟶ S := (Uc D).ι ≫ f

/-- Restriction of functions from an open of `X` to its trace on `U`. -/
private abbrev res (W' : X.Opens) : Γ(X, W') →+* Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W') :=
  ((Uc D).ι.app W').hom

/-- The generators of the logarithmic forms over an affine open `W'`: functions, their
differentials, and the forms `dt/t` for local equations `t` of components of `D`. -/
private def gens (W' : X.affineOpens) :
    Set ((TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)))) :=
  Set.range (fun a => sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' a)) ∪
    Set.range (fun a => δ (gU f D) _ (res D W' a)) ∪
    {η | ∃ E ∈ D.support, ∃ t : Γ(X, W'), E.idealSheaf.ideal W' = Ideal.span {t} ∧
      ∃ s, s * res D W' t = 1 ∧ η = sm (gU f D) _ s * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W' t)}

/-- The `I`-multiples of the ring generated by `gens`. -/
private noncomputable def logClosure (I : X.IdealSheafData) (W' : X.affineOpens) :
    AddSubgroup ((TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)))) :=
  AddSubgroup.closure {η | ∃ a ∈ I.ideal W', ∃ ζ ∈ Subring.closure (gens f D W'),
    η = sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' a) * ζ}

private theorem mem_relativeLogForms_iff (n : ℕ) [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) (I : X.IdealSheafData) (p : ℤ) (W : X.Opens)
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W))) :
    ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD I p W ↔
      ∀ x ∈ W, ∃ (W' : X.affineOpens) (h : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W), x ∈ (W' : X.Opens) ∧
        (TB (gU f D)).incl p (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece
          p).val.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op ω) ∈
          logClosure f D I W' :=
  Iff.rfl

private theorem res_restrict {W₁ W' : X.Opens} (h : W₁ ≤ W') (a : Γ(X, W')) :
    (Uc D).toScheme.presheaf.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op (res D W' a) =
      res D W₁ (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op a) :=
  (ConcreteCategory.congr_hom ((Uc D).ι.naturality (homOfLE h).op) a).symm

private theorem gens_restrict {W₁ W' : X.affineOpens} (h : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W')
    {z : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)))} (hz : z ∈ gens f D W') :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op z ∈
      gens f D W₁ := by
  rcases hz with (⟨a, rfl⟩ | ⟨a, rfl⟩) | ⟨E, hE, t, ht, s, hs, rfl⟩
  · refine Or.inl (Or.inl ⟨X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op a, ?_⟩)
    rw [totalRestrict_sm, res_restrict]
  · refine Or.inl (Or.inr ⟨X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op a, ?_⟩)
    rw [totalRestrict_δ, res_restrict]
  · refine Or.inr ⟨E, hE, X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op t, ?_,
      (Uc D).toScheme.presheaf.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op s, ?_, ?_⟩
    · rw [← E.idealSheaf.map_ideal h, ht, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton]
      rfl
    · rw [← res_restrict, ← map_mul, hs, map_one]
    · rw [Stacks.GradedAlgebra.totalRestrict_mul, totalRestrict_sm, totalRestrict_δ,
        res_restrict]

private theorem closure_gens_restrict {W₁ W' : X.affineOpens} (h : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W')
    {z : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)))}
    (hz : z ∈ Subring.closure (gens f D W')) :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op z ∈
      Subring.closure (gens f D W₁) := by
  let ρ := (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrictRingHom ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op
  have : Subring.closure (gens f D W') ≤ (Subring.closure (gens f D W₁)).comap ρ :=
    Subring.closure_le.mpr fun z hz => Subring.subset_closure (gens_restrict f D h hz)
  exact this hz

private theorem logClosure_restrict (I : X.IdealSheafData) {W₁ W' : X.affineOpens}
    (h : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W')
    {z : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)))} (hz : z ∈ logClosure f D I W') :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op z ∈
      logClosure f D I W₁ := by
  let ρ := (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrictRingHom ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op
  have : logClosure f D I W' ≤ (logClosure f D I W₁).comap ρ.toAddMonoidHom := by
    refine AddSubgroup.closure_le _ |>.mpr ?_
    rintro _ ⟨a, ha, ζ, hζ, rfl⟩
    refine AddSubgroup.subset_closure ⟨X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op a,
      I.ideal_le_comap_ideal h ha, _, closure_gens_restrict f D h hζ, ?_⟩
    change (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict _ (_ * _) = _
    rw [Stacks.GradedAlgebra.totalRestrict_mul, totalRestrict_sm, res_restrict]
  exact this hz

private theorem gens_hG (W' : X.affineOpens) :
    ∀ z ∈ gens f D W', ∃ b l, z = mon (gU f D) _ b l ∧
      dmon (gU f D) _ b l ∈ Subring.closure (gens f D W') := by
  rintro _ ((⟨a, rfl⟩ | ⟨a, rfl⟩) | ⟨E, hE, t, ht, s, hs, rfl⟩)
  · refine ⟨res D W' a, [], by simp [mon], ?_⟩
    simp only [dmon, List.map_nil, List.prod_nil, mul_one]
    exact Subring.subset_closure (Or.inl (Or.inr ⟨a, rfl⟩))
  · refine ⟨1, [res D W' a], by simp [mon], ?_⟩
    simp only [dmon, δ_one, zero_mul]
    exact Subring.zero_mem _
  · refine ⟨s, [res D W' t], by simp [mon], ?_⟩
    simp only [dmon, List.map_cons, List.map_nil, List.prod_cons, List.prod_nil, mul_one]
    rw [δ_mul_δ_of_mul_eq_one hs]
    exact Subring.zero_mem _

/-- The differential maps the logarithmic forms over an affine open to themselves. -/
private theorem Δ_mem_logClosure_top (W' : X.affineOpens) (p : ℕ)
    {z : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)))} (hz : z ∈ logClosure f D ⊤ W') :
    Δ (gU f D) _ p z ∈ logClosure f D ⊤ W' := by
  refine Δ_mem_closure (gens f D W') (gens_hG f D W') (res D W')
    ((⊤ : X.IdealSheafData).ideal W' : Set Γ(X, W')) ?_ p hz
  intro a _
  refine ⟨1, Submodule.mem_top, δ (gU f D) _ (res D W' a),
    Subring.subset_closure (Or.inl (Or.inr ⟨a, rfl⟩)), ?_⟩
  rw [map_one, map_one, one_mul]

private theorem deRham_restrict (p : ℕ) {W' W'' : X.Opens} (h : W' ≤ W'')
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W''))) :
    ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)).val.map
        ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op
        (((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (gU f D)).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W'')) ω) =
      ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (gU f D)).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W'))
        (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.map
          ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op ω) :=
  (PresheafOfModules.naturality_apply ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (gU f D)).d p (p + 1)).val
    ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op ω).symm

/-- **The differential preserves `Ω^•_{X/S}(log D)`.** -/
private theorem deRham_mem_relativeLogForms_top (n : ℕ) [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) (p : ℕ) (W'' : X.Opens)
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W'')))
    (hω : ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD ⊤ p W'') :
    ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (gU f D)).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W'')) ω ∈
      relativeLogForms n f D hD ⊤ ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ) W'' := by
  rw [mem_relativeLogForms_iff] at hω
  refine (mem_relativeLogForms_iff f D n hD _ _ _ _).mpr fun x hx => ?_
  obtain ⟨W', h, hxW', hmem⟩ := hω x hx
  refine ⟨W', h, hxW', ?_⟩
  exact (congrArg (· ∈ logClosure f D ⊤ W')
    ((congrArg ((TB (gU f D)).incl ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)) (deRham_restrict f D p h ω)).trans
      (Δ_incl p _).symm)).mpr (Δ_mem_logClosure_top f D W' p hmem)

/-- A section over `O` is a unit as soon as it is invertible at every point of `O`. -/
private theorem isUnit_of_le_basicOpen {Y : Scheme.{u}} {O : Y.Opens} (a : Γ(Y, O))
    (h : O ≤ Y.basicOpen a) : IsUnit a :=
  RingedSpace.isUnit_of_isUnit_germ Y.toRingedSpace O a fun x hx =>
    (Y.mem_basicOpen a x hx).mp (h hx)

/-- A local equation of a component of `D` is invertible on the complement `U` of `D`. -/
private theorem isUnit_res_of_ideal_eq {E : MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X} (hE : E ∈ D.support)
    {W₁ : X.affineOpens} {t : Γ(X, W₁)} (ht : E.idealSheaf.ideal W₁ = Ideal.span {t}) :
    IsUnit (res D W₁ t) := by
  refine isUnit_of_le_basicOpen _ fun y hy => ?_
  rw [← Scheme.preimage_basicOpen]
  by_contra hyt
  have hyW : ((Uc D).ι y) ∈ (W₁ : X.Opens) := hy
  have hmem : (Uc D).ι y ∈ E.support := by
    rw [AlgebraicGeometry.PrimeDivisor.support, SetLike.mem_coe,
      E.idealSheaf.mem_support_iff_of_mem hyW, ht, Scheme.mem_zeroLocus_iff]
    intro b hb hyb
    obtain ⟨c, rfl⟩ := Ideal.mem_span_singleton'.mp hb
    rw [Scheme.basicOpen_mul] at hyb
    exact hyt hyb.2
  exact (y.2 : (Uc D).ι y ∉ D.supp) (MMP.Mori.DivisorWithCoeffs.support_subset_supp
    (Finsupp.mem_support_iff.mp hE) hmem)

private theorem totalRestrict_incl_map (p : ℤ) {W₁ W' W'' : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W') (h : W' ≤ W'')
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W''))) :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h₁)).op
        ((TB (gU f D)).incl p (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece
          p).val.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op ω)) =
      (TB (gU f D)).incl p (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece
          p).val.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (h₁.trans h))).op ω) :=
  ((TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict_incl _ p _).trans (congrArg ((TB (gU f D)).incl p)
    ((Stacks.sectionRestrict_comp _ _ _ ω).symm.trans
      (congrArg (fun φ => Stacks.sectionRestrict _ φ ω) (Subsingleton.elim _ _))))

/-- On an affine open where the support of `D` is cut out by a product `t₁ ⋯ t_r` of local
equations of components of `D`, the differential maps `Ω^•(log D)(-D)` to itself. -/
private theorem Δ_mem_logClosure_suppIdeal {W₁ : X.affineOpens} {r : ℕ}
    (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X) (t : Fin r → Γ(X, W₁))
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W₁ = Ideal.span {t i})
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W₁ = Ideal.span {∏ i, t i}) (p : ℕ)
    {z : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)))}
    (hz : z ∈ logClosure f D D.suppIdeal W₁) :
    Δ (gU f D) _ p z ∈ logClosure f D D.suppIdeal W₁ := by
  have hu : ∀ i, IsUnit (res D W₁ (t i)) := fun i =>
    isUnit_res_of_ideal_eq D (hjD i).1 (hjD i).2
  let s : Fin r → Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)) := fun i => ↑(hu i).unit⁻¹
  have hs : ∀ i, s i * res D W₁ (t i) = 1 := fun i => (hu i).val_inv_mul
  refine Δ_mem_closure (gens f D W₁) (gens_hG f D W₁) (res D W₁)
    (D.suppIdeal.ideal W₁ : Set Γ(X, W₁)) ?_ p hz
  intro a ha
  rw [SetLike.mem_coe, hDW] at ha
  obtain ⟨b, rfl⟩ := Ideal.mem_span_singleton'.mp ha
  refine ⟨∏ i, t i, by rw [SetLike.mem_coe, hDW]; exact Ideal.mem_span_singleton_self _,
    δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ b) + sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ b) *
      ∑ i, sm (gU f D) _ (s i) * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (t i)), ?_, ?_⟩
  · refine Subring.add_mem _ (Subring.subset_closure (Or.inl (Or.inr ⟨b, rfl⟩)))
      (Subring.mul_mem _ (Subring.subset_closure (Or.inl (Or.inl ⟨b, rfl⟩)))
        (Subring.sum_mem _ fun i _ => Subring.subset_closure
          (Or.inr ⟨j i, (hjD i).1, t i, (hjD i).2, s i, hs i, rfl⟩)))
  · rw [map_mul, map_prod, δ_mul, δ_prod_eq _ s hs, mul_add, add_comm]
    congr 1
    rw [← mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc, ← map_mul, ← map_mul, mul_comm]

/-- **The differential preserves `Ω^•_{X/S}(log D)(-D)`.** -/
private theorem deRham_mem_relativeLogForms_suppIdeal (n : ℕ) [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) (p : ℕ) (W'' : X.Opens)
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W'')))
    (hω : ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal p W'') :
    ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (gU f D)).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W'')) ω ∈
      relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ) W'' := by
  rw [mem_relativeLogForms_iff] at hω
  refine (mem_relativeLogForms_iff f D n hD _ _ _ _).mpr fun x hx => ?_
  obtain ⟨W', h, hxW', hmem⟩ := hω x hx
  obtain ⟨Wc, Vc, ec, tc, hxc, -, rc, hrc, jc, -, hjDc, hDWc⟩ := hD.2 x
  obtain ⟨U₁, hU₁, hxU₁, hU₁le⟩ := Opens.isBasis_iff_nbhd.mp X.isBasis_affineOpens
    (show x ∈ (W' : X.Opens) ⊓ Wc from ⟨hxW', hxc⟩)
  let W₁ : X.affineOpens := ⟨U₁, hU₁⟩
  have h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W' := hU₁le.trans inf_le_left
  have h₁c : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ Wc := hU₁le.trans inf_le_right
  refine ⟨W₁, h₁.trans h, hxU₁, ?_⟩
  have hmem₁ := (congrArg (· ∈ logClosure f D D.suppIdeal W₁)
    (totalRestrict_incl_map f D (p : ℤ) h₁ h ω)).mp (logClosure_restrict f D D.suppIdeal h₁ hmem)
  have key := Δ_mem_logClosure_suppIdeal f D (W₁ := W₁) jc
    (fun i => X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₁c).op (tc (Fin.castLE hrc i)))
    (fun i => ⟨(hjDc i).1, by
      rw [← (jc i).idealSheaf.map_ideal h₁c, (hjDc i).2.2, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton]
      rfl⟩)
    (by
      rw [← D.suppIdeal.map_ideal h₁c, hDWc, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton, map_prod]
      rfl) p hmem₁
  exact (congrArg (· ∈ logClosure f D D.suppIdeal W₁)
    ((congrArg ((TB (gU f D)).incl ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ)) (deRham_restrict f D p (h₁.trans h) ω)).trans
      (Δ_incl p _).symm)).mpr key

end Log

/-! ### Local membership in an ideal sheaf -/

/-- **Membership in an ideal sheaf is local.** A function on an affine open `W'` lies in `I(W')` as
soon as its restrictions to the members of an affine open cover of `W'` lie in `I`. -/
private theorem mem_ideal_of_locally {X : Scheme.{u}} (I : X.IdealSheafData) {W' : X.affineOpens}
    (a : Γ(X, W'))
    (h : ∀ x ∈ (W' : X.Opens), ∃ (W₁ : X.affineOpens) (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W'),
      x ∈ (W₁ : X.Opens) ∧ X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₁).op a ∈ I.ideal W₁) :
    a ∈ I.ideal W' := by
  have key : ∀ x : (W' : X.Opens), ∃ g : Γ(X, W'), x.1 ∈ X.basicOpen g ∧
      ∃ k : ℕ, g ^ k * a ∈ I.ideal W' := by
    intro x
    obtain ⟨W₁, h₁, hx, ha⟩ := h x.1 x.2
    obtain ⟨g, hg, hxg⟩ := W'.2.exists_basicOpen_le ⟨x.1, hx⟩ x.2
    refine ⟨g, hxg, ?_⟩
    have haB : X.presheaf.map (homOfLE (X.basicOpen_le g)).op a ∈
        I.ideal (X.affineBasicOpen g) := by
      have := I.ideal_le_comap_ideal (U := X.affineBasicOpen g) (V := W₁) hg ha
      rwa [Ideal.mem_comap, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← Functor.map_comp] at this
    rw [← I.map_ideal (U := X.affineBasicOpen g) (V := W') (X.basicOpen_le g)] at haB
    have := W'.2.isLocalization_basicOpen g
    obtain ⟨⟨i, m⟩, him⟩ :=
      (IsLocalization.mem_map_algebraMap_iff (Submonoid.powers g) Γ(X, X.basicOpen g)).mp haB
    have him' : algebraMap Γ(X, W') Γ(X, X.basicOpen g) (a * (m : Γ(X, W'))) =
        algebraMap _ _ (i : Γ(X, W')) := by
      rwa [map_mul]
    obtain ⟨m', hm'⟩ := (IsLocalization.eq_iff_exists (Submonoid.powers g) _).mp him'
    obtain ⟨k1, hk1⟩ := m.2
    obtain ⟨k2, hk2⟩ := m'.2
    refine ⟨k2 + k1, ?_⟩
    have e : g ^ (k2 + k1) * a = m' * (a * m) := by
      rw [← hk1, ← hk2, pow_add]; ring
    rw [e, hm']
    exact (I.ideal W').mul_mem_left _ i.2
  choose g hxg k hk using key
  refine Submodule.mem_of_span_eq_top_of_smul_pow_mem _ (Set.range g) ?_ a ?_
  · rw [← W'.2.self_le_iSup_basicOpen_iff]
    exact fun x hx => TopologicalSpace.Opens.mem_iSup.mpr ⟨⟨_, ⟨x, hx⟩, rfl⟩, hxg ⟨x, hx⟩⟩
  · rintro ⟨_, x, rfl⟩
    exact ⟨k x, by rw [smul_eq_mul]; exact hk x⟩

/-! ### The chart -/

section Chart

variable {n : ℕ} {X S : Scheme.{u}} (f : X ⟶ S) (D : MMP.Mori.Divisor X) {W : X.affineOpens}
  (t : Fin n → Γ(X, W)) {r : ℕ} (s : Fin r → Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W : X.Opens)))

/-- The coordinates restricted to an open `W' ⊆ W`. -/
private noncomputable def tR {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (i : Fin n) : Γ(X, W') :=
  X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (t i)

/-- The restriction map from `U ∩ W` to `U ∩ W'`. -/
private abbrev φR {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) :
    op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W : X.Opens)) ⟶ op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W') :=
  ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE hW')).op

/-- The inverse `1/tᵢ` for `i < r`, and `1` otherwise, restricted to `U ∩ W'`. -/
private noncomputable def σR {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (i : Fin n) :
    Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W') :=
  if h : (i : ℕ) < r then (Uc D).toScheme.presheaf.map (φR D hW') (s ⟨i, h⟩) else 1

/-- The logarithmic coordinate forms `dtᵢ/tᵢ` (`i < r`) and `dtᵢ` (`i ≥ r`) over `U ∩ W'`. -/
private noncomputable def θR {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (i : Fin n) :
    (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W')) :=
  sm (gU f D) _ (σR D s hW' i) * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W' (tR t hW' i))

/-- The wedge `θ_K` of the logarithmic coordinate forms over a finite set `K`, in increasing
order. -/
private noncomputable def θK {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (K : Finset (Fin n)) :
    (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W')) :=
  ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map (θR f D t s hW')).prod

/-- The logarithmic coordinate forms over `U ∩ W`, as in the statement. -/
private noncomputable def θ0 (i : Fin n) : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W : X.Opens))) :=
  if h : (i : ℕ) < r then sm (gU f D) _ (s ⟨i, h⟩) * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W (t i))
  else δ (gU f D) _ (res D W (t i))

private theorem totalRestrict_θ0 {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (i : Fin n) :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict (φR D hW') (θ0 f D t s i) = θR f D t s hW' i := by
  unfold θ0 θR σR tR
  split_ifs with h
  · rw [Stacks.GradedAlgebra.totalRestrict_mul, totalRestrict_sm, totalRestrict_δ, res_restrict]
  · rw [totalRestrict_δ, res_restrict, map_one, one_mul]

private theorem θR_mul_self {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (i : Fin n) :
    θR f D t s hW' i * θR f D t s hW' i = 0 := by
  unfold θR
  rw [mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc (δ _ _ _), ← sm_comm, mul_assoc, δ_mul_self, mul_zero, mul_zero]

private theorem θR_anticomm {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (i j : Fin n) :
    θR f D t s hW' i * θR f D t s hW' j = -(θR f D t s hW' j * θR f D t s hW' i) := by
  unfold θR
  rw [mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc (δ _ _ _), ← sm_comm, mul_assoc, δ_anticomm, mul_assoc,
    ← mul_assoc (δ _ _ (res D W' (tR t hW' j))), ← sm_comm (c := σR D s hW' i), mul_assoc]
  simp only [mul_neg, ← mul_assoc, ← map_mul, mul_comm (σR D s hW' i)]

private theorem θK_eq {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (K : Finset (Fin n)) :
    θK f D t s hW' K = sm (gU f D) _ (((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map (σR D s hW')).prod) *
      ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map fun i => δ (gU f D) _ (res D W' (tR t hW' i))).prod :=
  prod_map_sm_mul _ _ _

variable {D t s} in
private theorem σR_mul (hr : r ≤ n)
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W)
    (i : Fin n) (hi : (i : ℕ) < r) : σR D s hW' i * res D W' (tR t hW' i) = 1 := by
  have e : t i = t (Fin.castLE hr ⟨i, hi⟩) := congrArg t (Fin.ext rfl)
  rw [σR, dite_eq_left hi, tR, ← res_restrict, e, ← map_mul, hs, map_one]

variable {D t s} in
private theorem isUnit_σR (hr : r ≤ n)
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W)
    (i : Fin n) : IsUnit (σR D s hW' i) := by
  by_cases hi : (i : ℕ) < r
  · exact isUnit_iff_exists_inv.mpr ⟨_, σR_mul hr hs hW' i hi⟩
  · rw [σR, dite_eq_right hi]; exact isUnit_one

/-- The map `appLE W W' h` of the identity morphism is the restriction map of the structure
presheaf. -/
public theorem appLE_id {X : Scheme.{u}} {W W' : X.Opens} (h : W' ≤ W) :
    (𝟙 X : X ⟶ X).appLE W W' h = X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op := by
  simp only [Scheme.Hom.appLE, Scheme.Hom.id_app]
  exact Category.id_comp _

/-- For affine opens `W' ≤ W` of a scheme, `Γ(X, W')` is flat over `Γ(X, W)` via restriction. -/
public theorem flat_map {X : Scheme.{u}} {W W' : X.affineOpens} (h : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    letI := (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op).hom.toAlgebra
    Module.Flat Γ(X, W) Γ(X, W') := by
  have := HasRingHomProperty.appLE @Flat (𝟙 X) inferInstance W W' h
  rwa [appLE_id] at this

private theorem formallyEtale_map {X : Scheme.{u}} {W W' : X.affineOpens}
    (h : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    letI := (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op).hom.toAlgebra
    Algebra.FormallyEtale Γ(X, W) Γ(X, W') := by
  have := HasRingHomProperty.appLE @Etale (𝟙 X) inferInstance W W' h
  rw [appLE_id] at this
  exact this.formallyEtale

variable {f t} in
/-- The product `t₁ ⋯ t_r` of the coordinates cutting out `D`, restricted to any affine open of
the chart, is a non-zero-divisor. -/
private theorem isSMulRegular_prod {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) {W' : X.affineOpens} (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    IsSMulRegular Γ(X, W') (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i))) := by
  let _ := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
  have : Algebra.Smooth Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) :=
    HasRingHomProperty.appLE @Smooth f (SmoothOfRelativeDimension.smooth n f) V W e
  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := hb
  have hreg : IsSMulRegular Γ(X, W) (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)) :=
    Finset.prod_induction _ _ (fun a b ha hb => ha.mul hb) (IsSMulRegular.one Γ(X, W))
      fun i _ => isSMulRegular_of_basis_D t b hb _
  let _ := (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op).hom.toAlgebra
  have := flat_map hW'
  exact hreg.of_flat

/-- On an affine open `W'`, restriction to the basic open of a non-zero-divisor `a` is
injective. -/
public theorem injective_map_of_eq_basicOpen {X : Scheme.{u}} {W' : X.Opens}
    (hW' : IsAffineOpen W')
    {a : Γ(X, W')} (ha : IsSMulRegular Γ(X, W') a) {O' : X.Opens} (hO : O' = X.basicOpen a)
    (h : O' ≤ W') : Function.Injective (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op).hom := by
  subst hO
  have := hW'.isLocalization_basicOpen a
  refine IsLocalization.injective (M := Submonoid.powers a) Γ(X, X.basicOpen a) ?_
  rintro _ ⟨k, rfl⟩
  refine mem_nonZeroDivisors_iff_right.mpr fun z hz => ?_
  refine (ha.pow k) ?_
  change a ^ k • z = a ^ k • 0
  rw [smul_eq_mul, smul_zero, mul_comm]
  exact hz

variable {D} in
/-- On an affine open `W'` where the support of `D` is cut out by `h`, a point of `W'` lies in the
support of `D` exactly when `h` vanishes at it. -/
private theorem mem_supp_iff_notMem_basicOpen {W' : X.affineOpens} {h : Γ(X, W')}
    (hI : D.suppIdeal.ideal W' = Ideal.span {h}) {x : X} (hx : x ∈ (W' : X.Opens)) :
    x ∈ (D.supp : Set X) ↔ x ∉ X.basicOpen h := by
  rw [← MMP.Mori.DivisorWithCoeffs.coe_support_suppIdeal, SetLike.mem_coe,
    D.suppIdeal.mem_support_iff_of_mem hx, hI, Scheme.zeroLocus_span, Scheme.zeroLocus_singleton]
  rfl

variable {D} in
private theorem basicOpen_eq_inf {W' : X.affineOpens} {h : Γ(X, W')}
    (hI : D.suppIdeal.ideal W' = Ideal.span {h}) : X.basicOpen h = Uc D ⊓ W' := by
  ext x
  constructor
  · intro hx
    have hxW : x ∈ (W' : X.Opens) := X.basicOpen_le h hx
    refine ⟨fun hxD => ?_, hxW⟩
    exact (mem_supp_iff_notMem_basicOpen hI hxW).mp hxD hx
  · rintro ⟨hxU, hxW⟩
    by_contra hx
    exact hxU ((mem_supp_iff_notMem_basicOpen hI hxW).mpr hx)

variable {D} in
private theorem res_injective {W' : X.affineOpens} {h : Γ(X, W')}
    (hI : D.suppIdeal.ideal W' = Ideal.span {h}) (hh : IsSMulRegular Γ(X, W') h) :
    Function.Injective (res D W') := by
  have e := Scheme.Opens.ι_app (Uc D) (W' : X.Opens)
  change Function.Injective ((Uc D).ι.app (W' : X.Opens)).hom
  rw [e]
  refine injective_map_of_eq_basicOpen W'.2 hh ?_ _
  rw [basicOpen_eq_inf hI, Scheme.Hom.image_preimage_eq_opensRange_inf, Scheme.Opens.opensRange_ι]

variable {D} in
private theorem isAffineOpen_preimage {W' : X.affineOpens} {h : Γ(X, W')}
    (hI : D.suppIdeal.ideal W' = Ideal.span {h}) :
    IsAffineOpen ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)) := by
  have hA : IsAffineOpen (X.basicOpen h) := W'.2.basicOpen h
  have hle : X.basicOpen h ≤ (Uc D).ι.opensRange := by
    rw [Scheme.Opens.opensRange_ι, basicOpen_eq_inf hI]; exact inf_le_left
  have := hA.preimage_of_isOpenImmersion (Uc D).ι hle
  convert this using 1
  rw [basicOpen_eq_inf hI]
  ext y
  exact ⟨fun hy => ⟨y.2, hy⟩, fun hy => hy.2⟩

variable {f t} in
private theorem preimage_le {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) :
    (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W' ≤ (gU f D) ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens) :=
  fun _ hy => e (hW' hy)

variable {f t} in
/-- **The differentials of the coordinates form a basis on `U ∩ W'`.** -/
private theorem exists_basis_res {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W) (hO : IsAffineOpen ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W')) :
    letI := ((gU f D).appLE V ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W') (preimage_le D e hW')).hom.toAlgebra
    ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W')
        Ω[Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W')⁄Γ(S, V)],
      ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W')
        (res D W' (tR t hW' i)) := by
  have e'' : (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ W' ≤ (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W : X.Opens) := fun _ hy => hW' hy
  have hE := HasRingHomProperty.appLE @Etale (Uc D).ι inferInstance W ⟨_, hO⟩ e''
  obtain ⟨b, hb⟩ := exists_basis_D_of_comp (f.appLE V W e).hom ((Uc D).ι.appLE W _ e'').hom
    ((gU f D).appLE V _ (preimage_le D e hW')).hom
    (by rw [← CommRingCat.hom_comp, Scheme.Hom.appLE_comp_appLE]) hE.formallyEtale t hb
  refine ⟨b, fun i => (hb i).trans ?_⟩
  congr 1
  exact (ConcreteCategory.congr_hom ((Uc D).ι.naturality (homOfLE hW').op) (t i)).symm

variable {D t} in
private theorem suppIdeal_ideal_eq {hr : r ≤ n}
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)}) {W' : X.affineOpens}
    (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    D.suppIdeal.ideal W' =
      Ideal.span {X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i))} := by
  rw [← D.suppIdeal.map_ideal hW', hDW, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton]
  rfl

variable {D t s} in
private theorem isUnit_prod_σR (hr : r ≤ n)
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) {W' : X.Opens} (hW' : W' ≤ W)
    (l : List (Fin n)) : IsUnit (l.map (σR D s hW')).prod :=
  List.prod_isUnit fun _ hm => by
    obtain ⟨i, -, rfl⟩ := List.mem_map.mp hm
    exact isUnit_σR hr hs hW' i

variable {f D t s} in
/-- **The wedges `θ_K` are independent over the functions on `W'`.** -/
private theorem combo_injective {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) (p : ℕ) {W' : X.affineOpens}
    (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    Function.Injective (fun c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W') =>
      ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1) := by
  have hI := suppIdeal_ideal_eq hDW hW'
  have hreg := isSMulRegular_prod e hb hr hW'
  have hO := isAffineOpen_preimage hI
  intro c c' hcc
  have hcc' : ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1 =
      ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c' K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1 := hcc
  let σK : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)) :=
    fun K => ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map (σR D s hW')).prod
  have hzero := eq_zero_of_sum_sm_mul_prod_eq_zero hO V.2 (preimage_le D e hW')
    (fun i => res D W' (tR t hW' i)) (exists_basis_res D e hb hW' hO) p
    (fun K => res D W' (c K - c' K) * σK K) (by
      rw [← sub_eq_zero, ← Finset.sum_sub_distrib] at hcc'
      rw [← hcc']
      refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => ?_
      rw [θK_eq, map_sub, map_mul, map_sub, ← sub_mul, mul_assoc])
  funext K
  have hK := congrFun hzero K
  have hu := isUnit_prod_σR hr hs hW' (K.1.sort (· ≤ ·))
  have h1 : res D W' (c K - c' K) = 0 := hu.mul_left_eq_zero.mp hK
  rw [map_sub, sub_eq_zero] at h1
  exact res_injective hI hreg h1

variable {f t} in
/-- **The differential of a function in the coordinates.** On an affine open `W₁` of the chart,
`d(a|_U) = ∑ cᵢ d(tᵢ|_U)` with coefficients `cᵢ` regular on `W₁`. -/
private theorem exists_δ_res_eq_sum {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    {W₁ : X.affineOpens} (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) (a : Γ(X, W₁)) :
    ∃ c : Fin n → Γ(X, W₁), δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) =
      ∑ i, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (c i)) * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (tR t h₁ i)) := by
  have e₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens) := h₁.trans e
  obtain ⟨b₂, hb₂⟩ := exists_basis_D_of_comp (f.appLE V W e).hom
    (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h₁).op).hom (f.appLE V W₁ e₁).hom
    (by rw [← CommRingCat.hom_comp, Scheme.Hom.appLE_map]) (formallyEtale_map h₁) t hb
  let _ := (f.appLE V W₁ e₁).hom.toAlgebra
  let _ : Algebra Γ(X, W₁) Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)) :=
    (res D W₁).toAlgebra
  let _ := ((gU f D).appLE V ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)) (preimage_le D e h₁)).hom.toAlgebra
  have : IsScalarTower Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W₁) Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)) :=
    IsScalarTower.of_algebraMap_eq fun v => by
      change ((gU f D).appLE V _ _).hom v =
        ((Uc D).ι.app (W₁ : X.Opens)).hom ((f.appLE V W₁ e₁).hom v)
      rw [← Scheme.Hom.appLE_eq_app, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply, Scheme.Hom.appLE_comp_appLE]
  let c : Fin n → Γ(X, W₁) := fun i => b₂.repr (KaehlerDifferential.D _ _ a) i
  refine ⟨c, ?_⟩
  have hD : KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W₁) a =
      ∑ i, c i • KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W₁) (tR t h₁ i) := by
    conv_lhs => rw [← b₂.sum_repr (KaehlerDifferential.D _ _ a)]
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun i _ => by rw [hb₂]; rfl
  have hD' := congrArg (KaehlerDifferential.map Γ(S, V) Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W₁)
    Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens))) hD
  rw [KaehlerDifferential.map_D, map_sum] at hD'
  simp only [map_smul, KaehlerDifferential.map_D] at hD'
  let L := Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.AffineOpenDeRham.kaehlerSectionsLinearMap (gU f D)
    (preimage_le D e h₁)
  have hD'' : KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens))
      (res D W₁ a) = ∑ x, res D W₁ (c x) • KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V)
        Γ((Uc D).toScheme, (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)) (res D W₁ (tR t h₁ x)) :=
    hD'.trans (Finset.sum_congr rfl fun x _ => (algebraMap_smul _ (c x) _).symm)
  have hdd : (Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation (gU f D)).d (X := op _) (res D W₁ a) =
      ∑ x, (show (Uc D).toScheme.ringCatSheaf.obj.obj (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens))) from
        res D W₁ (c x)) • (Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation (gU f D)).d (X := op _)
          (res D W₁ (tR t h₁ x)) := by
    have h1 := (congrArg L hD'').trans ((map_sum L _ _).trans
      (Finset.sum_congr rfl fun x _ => L.map_smul _ _))
    refine (Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.AffineDifferentials.kaehlerToSections_d (gU f D) V _
      (preimage_le D e h₁) (res D W₁ a)).symm.trans (h1.trans ?_)
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun x _ => congrArg _
      (Stacks.AlgebraicGeometry.AffineDifferentials.kaehlerToSections_d (gU f D) V _
        (preimage_le D e h₁) _)
  refine (congrArg (ι1 (gU f D) _) hdd).trans ?_
  rw [ι1_sum]
  exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun x _ => ι1_smul _ _

/-- The additive span of the forms `a · θ_K`, `a` a function on `W₁` lying in `I`. -/
private noncomputable def spanθ (I : X.IdealSheafData) {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    AddSubgroup ((TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)))) :=
  AddSubgroup.closure {z | ∃ a ∈ I.ideal W₁, ∃ K : Finset (Fin n),
    z = sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) * θK f D t s h₁ K}

private theorem θK_singleton {W₁ : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (i : Fin n) :
    θK f D t s h₁ {i} = θR f D t s h₁ i := by
  simp [θK]

private theorem θK_empty {W₁ : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) : θK f D t s h₁ ∅ = 1 := by
  simp [θK]

private theorem sm_mul_θK_mem {I : X.IdealSheafData} {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) {a : Γ(X, W₁)} (ha : a ∈ I.ideal W₁) (K : Finset (Fin n)) :
    sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) * θK f D t s h₁ K ∈ spanθ f D t s I h₁ :=
  AddSubgroup.subset_closure ⟨a, ha, K, rfl⟩

private theorem mul_mem_spanθ {I : X.IdealSheafData} {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) {x y : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)))}
    (hx : x ∈ spanθ f D t s ⊤ h₁) (hy : y ∈ spanθ f D t s I h₁) :
    x * y ∈ spanθ f D t s I h₁ := by
  induction hx using AddSubgroup.closure_induction with
  | mem x hx =>
    obtain ⟨a, -, K, rfl⟩ := hx
    induction hy using AddSubgroup.closure_induction with
    | mem y hy =>
      obtain ⟨b, hb, L, rfl⟩ := hy
      have e : sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) * θK f D t s h₁ K *
          (sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ b) * θK f D t s h₁ L) =
          sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (a * b)) * (θK f D t s h₁ K * θK f D t s h₁ L) := by
        rw [map_mul, map_mul, mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc (θK f D t s h₁ K), ← sm_comm, mul_assoc,
          mul_assoc]
      rw [e]
      rcases prod_sort_mul_prod_sort (θR f D t s h₁) (θR_mul_self f D t s h₁)
        (θR_anticomm f D t s h₁) K L with h | h | h
      · rw [θK, θK, h, mul_zero]; exact AddSubgroup.zero_mem _
      · rw [θK, θK, h]
        exact sm_mul_θK_mem f D t s h₁ (I.ideal W₁ |>.mul_mem_left a hb) (K ∪ L)
      · rw [θK, θK, h, mul_neg]
        exact AddSubgroup.neg_mem _ (sm_mul_θK_mem f D t s h₁ (I.ideal W₁ |>.mul_mem_left a hb) _)
    | zero => rw [mul_zero]; exact AddSubgroup.zero_mem _
    | add y y' _ _ hy hy' => rw [mul_add]; exact AddSubgroup.add_mem _ hy hy'
    | neg y _ hy => rw [mul_neg]; exact AddSubgroup.neg_mem _ hy
  | zero => rw [zero_mul]; exact AddSubgroup.zero_mem _
  | add x x' _ _ hx hx' => rw [add_mul]; exact AddSubgroup.add_mem _ hx hx'
  | neg x _ hx => rw [neg_mul]; exact AddSubgroup.neg_mem _ hx

/-- The span of the forms `a · θ_K` is a subring. -/
private noncomputable def spanθRing {W₁ : X.affineOpens} (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    Subring ((TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)))) where
  __ := spanθ f D t s ⊤ h₁
  mul_mem' hx hy := mul_mem_spanθ f D t s h₁ hx hy
  one_mem' := by
    have := sm_mul_θK_mem f D t s h₁ (I := ⊤) (a := 1) Submodule.mem_top ∅
    rwa [θK_empty, map_one, map_one, one_mul] at this

private theorem mem_basicOpen_prod {X : Scheme.{u}} {O : X.Opens} {ι : Type*} (s : Finset ι)
    (a : ι → Γ(X, O)) {x : X} (hx : x ∈ O) (h : ∀ i ∈ s, x ∈ X.basicOpen (a i)) :
    x ∈ X.basicOpen (∏ i ∈ s, a i) :=
  Finset.prod_induction a (fun b => x ∈ X.basicOpen b)
    (fun b c hb hc => by rw [Scheme.basicOpen_mul]; exact ⟨hb, hc⟩)
    (by rw [Scheme.basicOpen_one]; exact hx) h

private theorem sm_res_mem_spanθRing {W₁ : X.affineOpens} (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W)
    (a : Γ(X, W₁)) : sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) ∈ spanθRing f D t s h₁ := by
  have := sm_mul_θK_mem f D t s h₁ (I := ⊤) (a := a) Submodule.mem_top ∅
  rwa [θK_empty, mul_one] at this

private theorem θR_mem_spanθRing {W₁ : X.affineOpens} (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) (i : Fin n) :
    θR f D t s h₁ i ∈ spanθRing f D t s h₁ := by
  have := sm_mul_θK_mem f D t s h₁ (I := ⊤) (a := 1) Submodule.mem_top {i}
  rwa [θK_singleton, map_one, map_one, one_mul] at this

variable {f t s} in
private theorem δ_res_mem_spanθRing {V : S.affineOpens}
    (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1)
    {W₁ : X.affineOpens} (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) (a : Γ(X, W₁)) :
    δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) ∈ spanθRing f D t s h₁ := by
  obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := exists_δ_res_eq_sum D e hb h₁ a
  rw [hc]
  refine Subring.sum_mem _ fun i _ => ?_
  obtain ⟨ρ, hρ⟩ : ∃ ρ : Γ(X, W₁), δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (tR t h₁ i)) =
      sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ ρ) * θR f D t s h₁ i := by
    by_cases hi : (i : ℕ) < r
    · refine ⟨tR t h₁ i, ?_⟩
      rw [θR, ← mul_assoc, ← map_mul, mul_comm, σR_mul hr hs h₁ i hi, map_one, one_mul]
    · refine ⟨1, ?_⟩
      simp only [θR, σR, dite_eq_right hi, map_one, one_mul]
  rw [hρ]
  exact Subring.mul_mem _ (sm_res_mem_spanθRing f D t s h₁ _)
    (Subring.mul_mem _ (sm_res_mem_spanθRing f D t s h₁ _) (θR_mem_spanθRing f D t s h₁ i))

variable {D t} in
/-- A component of `D` other than the `j i` misses the chart: its local equation is invertible on
`W₁`. -/
private theorem le_basicOpen_of_notMem_range (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)}) {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) {E : MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X} (hE : E ∈ D.support)
    (hEj : ¬∃ i, E = j i) {t' : Γ(X, W₁)} (ht' : E.idealSheaf.ideal W₁ = Ideal.span {t'}) :
    (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ X.basicOpen t' := by
  intro y hy
  by_contra hyt
  have hyE : y ∈ E.support := by
    rw [AlgebraicGeometry.PrimeDivisor.support, SetLike.mem_coe,
      E.idealSheaf.mem_support_iff_of_mem hy, ht', Scheme.zeroLocus_span,
      Scheme.zeroLocus_singleton]
    exact hyt
  have hη : E.genericPoint ∈ (W₁ : X.Opens) := by
    have hsp : E.genericPoint ⤳ y := by
      rw [specializes_iff_mem_closure, ← AlgebraicGeometry.PrimeDivisor.support_eq_closure]
      exact hyE
    exact hsp.mem_open W₁.1.isOpen hy
  have hηE : E.genericPoint ∈ E.support := by
    rw [AlgebraicGeometry.PrimeDivisor.support_eq_closure]
    exact subset_closure rfl
  have hηD : E.genericPoint ∈ (D.supp : Set X) :=
    MMP.Mori.DivisorWithCoeffs.support_subset_supp (Finsupp.mem_support_iff.mp hE) hηE
  have hηW : E.genericPoint ∈ (W : X.Opens) := h₁ hη
  have hnot := (mem_supp_iff_notMem_basicOpen hDW hηW).mp hηD
  obtain ⟨i, -, hi⟩ :
      ∃ i ∈ Finset.univ, E.genericPoint ∉ X.basicOpen (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) := by
    by_contra hall
    simp only [not_exists, not_and, not_not] at hall
    exact hnot (mem_basicOpen_prod _ _ hηW hall)
  have hηj : E.genericPoint ∈ (j i).support := by
    rw [AlgebraicGeometry.PrimeDivisor.support, SetLike.mem_coe,
      (j i).idealSheaf.mem_support_iff_of_mem hηW, (hjD i).2, Scheme.zeroLocus_span,
      Scheme.zeroLocus_singleton]
    exact hi
  exact hEj ⟨i, (MMP.Intersection.primeDivisor_eq_of_genericPoint_mem_support hηj).symm⟩

variable {f t s} in
/-- **The generators of the logarithmic forms are combinations of the `θ_K`.** -/
private theorem gens_subset_spanθRing {V : S.affineOpens}
    (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    gens f D W₁ ⊆ spanθRing f D t s h₁ := by
  have hsm := sm_res_mem_spanθRing f D t s h₁
  have hθ := θR_mem_spanθRing f D t s h₁
  have hδ := δ_res_mem_spanθRing D e hb hr hs h₁
  rintro _ ((⟨a, rfl⟩ | ⟨a, rfl⟩) | ⟨E, hE, t', ht', s', hs', rfl⟩)
  · exact hsm a
  · exact hδ a
  · by_cases hEj : ∃ i, E = j i
    · obtain ⟨i, rfl⟩ := hEj
      set i' : Fin n := Fin.castLE hr i
      have hi' : (i' : ℕ) < r := i.2
      have hti : (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W₁ = Ideal.span {tR t h₁ i'} := by
        rw [← (j i).idealSheaf.map_ideal h₁, (hjD i).2, Ideal.map_span, Set.image_singleton]
        rfl
      obtain ⟨u, hu⟩ : ∃ u, u * tR t h₁ i' = t' :=
        Ideal.mem_span_singleton'.mp (by rw [← hti, ht']; exact Ideal.mem_span_singleton_self t')
      obtain ⟨v, hv⟩ : ∃ v, v * t' = tR t h₁ i' :=
        Ideal.mem_span_singleton'.mp (by rw [← ht', hti]; exact Ideal.mem_span_singleton_self _)
      have hσ := σR_mul hr hs h₁ i' hi'
      have h2 : s' * res D W₁ u * res D W₁ (tR t h₁ i') = 1 := by
        rw [mul_assoc, ← map_mul, hu, hs']
      have e1 : s' * res D W₁ u = σR D s h₁ i' :=
        left_inv_eq_right_inv h2 (by rw [mul_comm, hσ])
      have e2 : s' * res D W₁ (tR t h₁ i') = res D W₁ v := by
        rw [← hv, map_mul, mul_comm (res D W₁ v), ← mul_assoc, hs', one_mul]
      have e3 : sm (gU f D) _ s' * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ t') =
          θR f D t s h₁ i' + sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ v) * δ (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ u) := by
        rw [← hu, map_mul, δ_mul, mul_add, ← mul_assoc, ← mul_assoc, ← map_mul, ← map_mul, e1,
          e2, θR]
      rw [e3]
      exact Subring.add_mem _ (hθ i') (Subring.mul_mem _ (hsm v) (hδ u))
    · have hu :=
        isUnit_of_le_basicOpen t' (le_basicOpen_of_notMem_range hr j hjD hDW h₁ hE hEj ht')
      have hs'' : s' = res D W₁ ↑hu.unit⁻¹ :=
        left_inv_eq_right_inv hs' (by rw [← map_mul, hu.mul_val_inv, map_one])
      rw [hs'']
      exact Subring.mul_mem _ (hsm _) (hδ t')

variable {f t s} in
private theorem logClosure_le_spanθ {V : S.affineOpens}
    (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) (I : X.IdealSheafData)
    {W₁ : X.affineOpens} (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) :
    logClosure f D I W₁ ≤ spanθ f D t s I h₁ := by
  refine (AddSubgroup.closure_le _).mpr ?_
  rintro _ ⟨a, ha, ζ, hζ, rfl⟩
  have hζ' : ζ ∈ spanθRing f D t s h₁ :=
    (Subring.closure_le.mpr (gens_subset_spanθRing D e hb hr j hjD hDW hs h₁)) hζ
  rw [sm_comm]
  refine mul_mem_spanθ f D t s h₁ hζ' ?_
  have := sm_mul_θK_mem f D t s h₁ ha ∅
  rwa [θK_empty, mul_one] at this

/-- A combination `∑_K a_K θ_K`, with coefficients indexed by all finite sets. -/
private theorem exists_eq_sum_of_mem_spanθ {I : X.IdealSheafData} {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) {z : (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens)))}
    (hz : z ∈ spanθ f D t s I h₁) :
    ∃ c : Finset (Fin n) → Γ(X, W₁), (∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal W₁) ∧
      z = ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (c K)) * θK f D t s h₁ K := by
  classical
  induction hz using AddSubgroup.closure_induction with
  | mem z hz =>
    obtain ⟨a, ha, K, rfl⟩ := hz
    refine ⟨Pi.single K a, fun L => ?_, ?_⟩
    · by_cases hL : L = K
      · subst hL; simpa using ha
      · simp [hL]
    · rw [Finset.sum_eq_single K (fun L _ hL => by simp [hL])
        (fun h => absurd (Finset.mem_univ K) h)]
      simp
  | zero => exact ⟨0, fun _ => Submodule.zero_mem _, by simp⟩
  | add z z' _ _ hz hz' =>
    obtain ⟨c, hc, rfl⟩ := hz
    obtain ⟨c', hc', rfl⟩ := hz'
    refine ⟨c + c', fun K => Submodule.add_mem _ (hc K) (hc' K), ?_⟩
    rw [← Finset.sum_add_distrib]
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => by rw [Pi.add_apply, map_add, map_add, add_mul]
  | neg z _ hz =>
    obtain ⟨c, hc, rfl⟩ := hz
    refine ⟨-c, fun K => Submodule.neg_mem _ (hc K), ?_⟩
    rw [← Finset.sum_neg_distrib]
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => by rw [Pi.neg_apply, map_neg, map_neg, neg_mul]

/-- `a · θ_K` is homogeneous of degree `|K|`. -/
private theorem incl_proj_sm_mul_θK {W₁ : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (a : Γ(X, W₁))
    (K : Finset (Fin n)) (p : ℕ) :
    (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ((TB (gU f D)).proj _ (p : ℤ)
        (sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) * θK f D t s h₁ K)) =
      if K.card = p then sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) * θK f D t s h₁ K else 0 := by
  set l := (K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map fun i => res D W₁ (tR t h₁ i)
  have hl : l.length = K.card := by simp [l]
  have hmon : sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a) * θK f D t s h₁ K =
      mon (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ a * ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map (σR D s h₁)).prod) l := by
    rw [θK_eq, mon, map_mul, mul_assoc, List.map_map]
    rfl
  obtain ⟨x, hx, -⟩ := exists_incl_eq_mon (g := gU f D) _
    (res D W₁ a * ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map (σR D s h₁)).prod) l
  rw [hmon, ← hx]
  split_ifs with h
  · have : l.length = p := hl.trans h
    subst this
    rw [(TB (gU f D)).proj_incl]
  · rw [proj_incl_of_ne (by exact_mod_cast (hl.trans_ne h))]
    exact (TB (gU f D)).incl_zero _

private theorem exists_coeff_of_incl_mem_spanθ {I : X.IdealSheafData} {W₁ : X.affineOpens}
    (h₁ : (W₁ : X.Opens) ≤ W) (p : ℕ)
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece (p : ℤ)).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W₁ : X.Opens))))
    (hω : (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω ∈ spanθ f D t s I h₁) :
    ∃ c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W₁), (∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal W₁) ∧
      (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω =
        ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (c K)) * θK f D t s h₁ K.1 := by
  classical
  obtain ⟨c, hc, hz⟩ := exists_eq_sum_of_mem_spanθ f D t s h₁ hω
  refine ⟨fun K => c K.1, fun K => hc K.1, ?_⟩
  have h1 : (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω = (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ)
      ((TB (gU f D)).proj _ (p : ℤ) ((TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω)) := by
    rw [(TB (gU f D)).proj_incl]
  rw [h1, hz, map_sum, incl_sum]
  simp only [incl_proj_sm_mul_θK]
  rw [← Finset.sum_filter]
  exact Finset.sum_subtype _ (fun K => by simp) _

variable {t} in
private theorem tR_restrict {W₁ W'' : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (h : W'' ≤ W₁) (i : Fin n) :
    X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op (tR t h₁ i) = tR t (h.trans h₁) i := by
  rw [tR, tR, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← Functor.map_comp]
  rfl

variable {D s} in
private theorem σR_restrict {W₁ W'' : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (h : W'' ≤ W₁) (i : Fin n) :
    (Uc D).toScheme.presheaf.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op (σR D s h₁ i) =
      σR D s (h.trans h₁) i := by
  unfold σR
  split_ifs
  · rw [← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← Functor.map_comp]
    rfl
  · exact map_one _

private theorem totalRestrict_θR {W₁ W'' : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (h : W'' ≤ W₁) (i : Fin n) :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op
      (θR f D t s h₁ i) = θR f D t s (h.trans h₁) i := by
  rw [θR, θR, Stacks.GradedAlgebra.totalRestrict_mul, totalRestrict_sm, totalRestrict_δ,
    σR_restrict, res_restrict, tR_restrict]

private theorem totalRestrict_θK {W₁ W'' : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (h : W'' ≤ W₁)
    (K : Finset (Fin n)) :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op
      (θK f D t s h₁ K) = θK f D t s (h.trans h₁) K := by
  have := map_list_prod ((TB (gU f D)).totalRestrictRingHom
    ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op) ((K.sort (· ≤ ·)).map (θR f D t s h₁))
  rw [List.map_map] at this
  refine this.trans ?_
  rw [θK]
  congr 1
  exact List.map_congr_left fun i _ => totalRestrict_θR f D t s h₁ h i

private theorem totalRestrict_combo {W₁ W'' : X.Opens} (h₁ : W₁ ≤ W) (h : W'' ≤ W₁) {p : ℕ}
    (c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W₁)) :
    (TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE h)).op
      (∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W₁ (c K)) * θK f D t s h₁ K.1) =
      ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W'' (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE h).op (c K))) *
        θK f D t s (h.trans h₁) K.1 := by
  rw [map_sum]
  refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => ?_
  rw [Stacks.GradedAlgebra.totalRestrict_mul, totalRestrict_sm, totalRestrict_θK, res_restrict]

/-- Sections over an open cover which agree on every affine open inside two members of the
cover are compatible. -/
private theorem isCompatible_of_affine {X : Scheme.{u}} {ι : Type*} (U : ι → X.Opens)
    (c : ∀ x, Γ(X, U x))
    (h : ∀ x y (B : X.affineOpens) (hBx : (B : X.Opens) ≤ U x) (hBy : (B : X.Opens) ≤ U y),
      X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hBx).op (c x) = X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hBy).op (c y)) :
    TopCat.Presheaf.IsCompatible X.sheaf.obj U c := by
  intro x y
  have hB : ∀ z : (U x ⊓ U y : X.Opens), ∃ B : X.affineOpens,
      z.1 ∈ (B : X.Opens) ∧ (B : X.Opens) ≤ U x ⊓ U y := fun z => by
    obtain ⟨B, hB, hzB, hle⟩ := Opens.isBasis_iff_nbhd.mp X.isBasis_affineOpens z.2
    exact ⟨⟨B, hB⟩, hzB, hle⟩
  choose B hzB hBle using hB
  refine TopCat.Sheaf.eq_of_locally_eq' X.sheaf (fun z => (B z : X.Opens)) _
    (fun z => homOfLE (hBle z))
    (fun z hz => TopologicalSpace.Opens.mem_iSup.mpr ⟨⟨z, hz⟩, hzB ⟨z, hz⟩⟩) _ _ fun z => ?_
  change X.presheaf.map (homOfLE (hBle z)).op (X.presheaf.map (Opens.infLELeft (U x) (U y)).op
      (c x)) =
    X.presheaf.map (homOfLE (hBle z)).op (X.presheaf.map (Opens.infLERight (U x) (U y)).op (c y))
  rw [← CommRingCat.comp_apply, ← Functor.map_comp, ← CommRingCat.comp_apply,
    ← Functor.map_comp]
  exact h x y (B z) ((hBle z).trans inf_le_left) ((hBle z).trans inf_le_right)

variable {f t s} in
/-- A `p`-form on `W'` which, on each member of an affine cover, is the combination of the `θ_K`
with coefficients restricted from `c`, is that combination on `W'`. -/
private theorem incl_eq_combo_of_cover {W' : X.affineOpens} (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) {p : ℕ}
    {ι : Type*} (U' : ι → X.affineOpens) (hU' : ∀ x, (U' x : X.Opens) ≤ W')
    (hcov : (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens) ≤ iSup fun x => (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (U' x : X.Opens))
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece (p : ℤ)).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens))))
    (c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W'))
    (hω : ∀ x, (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ)
      (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.map
        ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (hU' x))).op ω) =
      ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D (U' x) (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE (hU' x)).op (c K))) *
        θK f D t s ((hU' x).trans hW') K.1) :
    (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω = ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1 := by
  set F := ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1
  have hF : (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ((TB (gU f D)).proj _ (p : ℤ) F) = F := by
    rw [map_sum, incl_sum]
    exact Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ =>
      (incl_proj_sm_mul_θK f D t s hW' (c K) K.1 p).trans (ite_eq_left K.2)
  rw [← hF]
  congr 1
  refine piece_ext (g := gU f D) (p : ℤ) (fun x => (Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (U' x : X.Opens))
    (fun x => (Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (hU' x))) hcov _ _ fun x => ?_
  apply (TB (gU f D)).incl_inj_of_proj
  refine (hω x).trans ?_
  have h2 := congrArg ((TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict
    ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (hU' x))).op) hF
  rw [Stacks.GradedAlgebra.totalRestrict_incl] at h2
  exact (totalRestrict_combo f D t s hW' (hU' x) c).symm.trans h2.symm

variable {f t s} in
/-- **Logarithmic forms on an affine open of the chart are combinations of the `θ_K`.** The local
expressions provided by the definition glue, by the independence of the `θ_K`. -/
private theorem exists_coeff_of_mem_relativeLogForms [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) (I : X.IdealSheafData) (p : ℕ)
    {W' : X.affineOpens} (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W)
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece (p : ℤ)).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens))))
    (hω : ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD I p W') :
    ∃ c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W'), (∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal W') ∧
      (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω = ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1 := by
  classical
  rw [mem_relativeLogForms_iff] at hω
  choose Wx hWx hxWx hmem using hω
  let ι := (W' : X.Opens)
  let U' : ι → X.affineOpens := fun x => Wx x.1 x.2
  have hU' : ∀ x : ι, (U' x : X.Opens) ≤ W' := fun x => hWx x.1 x.2
  have hcov : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ iSup fun x : ι => (U' x : X.Opens) := fun x hx =>
    TopologicalSpace.Opens.mem_iSup.mpr ⟨⟨x, hx⟩, hxWx x hx⟩
  have hcx : ∀ x : ι, ∃ c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, U' x),
      (∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal (U' x)) ∧
      (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece
        p).val.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (hU' x))).op ω) =
        ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D (U' x) (c K)) * θK f D t s ((hU' x).trans hW') K.1 :=
    fun x => exists_coeff_of_incl_mem_spanθ f D t s ((hU' x).trans hW') p _
      (logClosure_le_spanθ D e hb hr j hjD hDW hs I ((hU' x).trans hW') (hmem x.1 x.2))
  choose cx hcxI hcx using hcx
  have hres : ∀ (x : ι) (B : X.affineOpens) (hB : (B : X.Opens) ≤ U' x),
      (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) (((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece
        p).val.map ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (hB.trans (hU' x)))).op ω) =
      ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D B (X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hB).op (cx x K))) *
        θK f D t s (hB.trans ((hU' x).trans hW')) K.1 := by
    intro x B hB
    have := congrArg ((TB (gU f D)).totalRestrict ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE hB)).op)
      (hcx x)
    rwa [totalRestrict_incl_map, totalRestrict_combo] at this
  have hcompat K : TopCat.Presheaf.IsCompatible X.sheaf.obj
      (fun x : ι => (U' x : X.Opens)) (fun x => cx x K) :=
    isCompatible_of_affine _ _ fun x y B hBx hBy => congrFun (combo_injective e hb hr hDW hs p
      (hBx.trans ((hU' x).trans hW')) ((hres x B hBx).symm.trans (hres y B hBy))) K
  choose c hc _ using fun K => TopCat.Sheaf.existsUnique_gluing' X.sheaf
    (fun x : ι => (U' x : X.Opens)) W' (fun x => homOfLE (hU' x)) hcov (fun x => cx x K)
    (hcompat K)
  refine ⟨c, fun K => mem_ideal_of_locally I (c K) fun x hx =>
    ⟨U' ⟨x, hx⟩, hU' _, hxWx x hx, ?_⟩, ?_⟩
  · have := hc K ⟨x, hx⟩
    change X.presheaf.map (homOfLE (hU' ⟨x, hx⟩)).op (c K) = cx ⟨x, hx⟩ K at this
    rw [this]
    exact hcxI _ K
  · refine incl_eq_combo_of_cover D hW' U' hU' (fun y hy => TopologicalSpace.Opens.mem_iSup.mpr
      ⟨⟨_, hy⟩, hxWx ((Uc D).ι y) hy⟩) ω c fun x => (hcx x).trans ?_
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => ?_
    have := hc K x
    change X.presheaf.map (homOfLE (hU' x)).op (c K) = cx x K at this
    rw [this]

variable {f t s} in
private theorem θR_mem_gens (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) {W' : X.affineOpens}
    (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) (i : Fin n) : θR f D t s hW' i ∈ gens f D W' := by
  by_cases hi : (i : ℕ) < r
  · refine Or.inr ⟨j ⟨i, hi⟩, (hjD ⟨i, hi⟩).1, tR t hW' i, ?_, σR D s hW' i,
      σR_mul hr hs hW' i hi, rfl⟩
    have e : t i = t (Fin.castLE hr ⟨i, hi⟩) := congrArg t (Fin.ext rfl)
    rw [← (j ⟨i, hi⟩).idealSheaf.map_ideal hW', (hjD ⟨i, hi⟩).2, Ideal.map_span,
      Set.image_singleton, tR, e]
    rfl
  · refine Or.inl (Or.inr ⟨tR t hW' i, ?_⟩)
    simp only [θR, σR, dite_eq_right hi, map_one, one_mul]

variable {f t s} in
private theorem θK_mem_closure (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) {W' : X.affineOpens}
    (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W) (K : Finset (Fin n)) :
    θK f D t s hW' K ∈ Subring.closure (gens f D W') :=
  Subring.list_prod_mem _ fun x hx => by
    obtain ⟨i, -, rfl⟩ := List.mem_map.mp hx
    exact Subring.subset_closure (θR_mem_gens D hr j hjD hs hW' i)

variable {f t s} in
/-- A combination of the `θ_K` with coefficients in `I` is a logarithmic form twisted by `I`. -/
private theorem mem_relativeLogForms_of_eq [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) (I : X.IdealSheafData) (p : ℕ)
    {W' : X.affineOpens} (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W)
    (ω : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece (p : ℤ)).val.obj
      (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens))))
    (c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W')) (hc : ∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal W')
    (hω : (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω =
      ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * θK f D t s hW' K.1) :
    ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD I p W' := by
  refine (mem_relativeLogForms_iff f D n hD I p W' ω).mpr fun x hx => ⟨W', le_rfl, hx, ?_⟩
  have e : ((Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (gU f D)).piece p).val.map
      ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (le_refl (W' : X.Opens)))).op ω = ω := by
    rw [show ((Opens.map (Uc D).ι.base).map (homOfLE (le_refl (W' : X.Opens)))).op = 𝟙 _ from
      Subsingleton.elim _ _]
    exact Stacks.sectionRestrict_id _ _ ω
  rw [e, hω]
  exact AddSubgroup.sum_mem _ fun K _ => AddSubgroup.subset_closure
    ⟨c K, hc K, _, θK_mem_closure D hr j hjD hs hW' K.1, rfl⟩

variable {f t s} in
/-- **The basis on an affine open of the chart**: the four statements of the lemma over a single
affine open `W' ⊆ W`, for any family `θ'` agreeing with the restricted logarithmic coordinate
forms. -/
private theorem relativeLogForms_basis_of_le [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f]
    (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) {V : S.affineOpens} (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
    (hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
      ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
        ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
    (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → MMP.Mori.PrimeDivisor X)
    (hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
    (hs : ∀ i : Fin r, s i * res D W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1) (p : ℕ)
    {W' : X.affineOpens} (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W)
    (θ' : Fin n → (TB (gU f D)).Total (op ((Uc D).ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens))))
    (hθ' : ∀ i, θ' i = θR f D t s hW' i) :
    Function.Injective (fun c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W') =>
        ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ').prod) ∧
      (∀ (I : X.IdealSheafData) ω, ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD I p W' ↔
        ∃ c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W'), (∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal W') ∧
          (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω =
            ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W' (c K)) * ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ').prod) ∧
      Function.Injective (fun c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W') =>
        ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W'
          ((X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)) • c) K)) *
          ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ').prod) ∧
      (∀ ω, ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal p W' ↔
        ∃ c : {K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W'), (TB (gU f D)).incl (p : ℤ) ω =
          ∑ K, sm (gU f D) _ (res D W'
            ((X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)) • c) K)) *
            ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map θ').prod) := by
  obtain rfl : θ' = θR f D t s hW' := funext hθ'
  have hreg := isSMulRegular_prod e hb hr hW'
  have hI := suppIdeal_ideal_eq hDW hW'
  refine ⟨combo_injective e hb hr hDW hs p hW', fun I ω =>
    ⟨fun hω => exists_coeff_of_mem_relativeLogForms D hD e hb hr j hjD hDW hs I p hW' ω hω,
      fun ⟨c, hc, hω⟩ => mem_relativeLogForms_of_eq D hD hr j hjD hs I p hW' ω c hc hω⟩, ?_, ?_⟩
  · exact fun c c' hcc => funext fun K =>
      hreg (congrFun (combo_injective e hb hr hDW hs p hW' hcc) K)
  · refine fun ω => ⟨fun hω => ?_, fun ⟨c, hω⟩ => ?_⟩
    · obtain ⟨c, hc, hω⟩ :=
        exists_coeff_of_mem_relativeLogForms D hD e hb hr j hjD hDW hs _ p hW' ω hω
      have hc' : ∀ K, ∃ c' : Γ(X, W'),
          c' * X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = c K := fun K =>
        Ideal.mem_span_singleton'.mp (hI ▸ hc K)
      choose c' hc' using hc'
      refine ⟨c', hω.trans (Finset.sum_congr rfl fun K _ => ?_)⟩
      rw [Pi.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, mul_comm, hc']
      rfl
    · refine mem_relativeLogForms_of_eq D hD hr j hjD hs _ p hW' ω _ (fun K => ?_) hω
      rw [hI, Pi.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
      exact Ideal.mul_mem_right _ _ (Ideal.mem_span_singleton_self _)

end Chart

end MMP.Mori.Divisor.MmpRelativeLogFormsBasisProof

end

section

/-!
# Relative logarithmic forms are locally free and closed under `d`

Let `f : X ⟶ S` be smooth of relative dimension `n`, `D` a relative simple normal crossing
divisor on `X`, `U = X ∖ D` and `j : U ⟶ X` the inclusion. On an affine chart `W` with relative
coordinates `t₁, …, tₙ` in which `D ∩ W = {t₁ ⋯ t_r = 0}`, the sheaf `Ω¹_{X/S}(log D)` is free
with basis `dt₁/t₁, …, dt_r/t_r, dt_{r+1}, …, dtₙ`. Consequently `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` is free on
`W` with basis the wedges `θ_K = θ_{k₁} ∧ ⋯ ∧ θ_{k_p}`, `K = {k₁ < ⋯ < k_p}`, of these forms, so
it is locally free of rank `n.choose p`; more generally the sections of `I · Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)`
are the combinations of the `θ_K` with coefficients in `I`, and `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D)` is free on
`W` with basis the `(t₁ ⋯ t_r) θ_K`. The relative de Rham differential of `j_*Ω^•_{U/S}` maps
`Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` into `Ω^{p+1}_{X/S}(log D)` and `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D)` into
`Ω^{p+1}_{X/S}(log D)(-D)`.

## Main results

* `MMP.Mori.Divisor.relativeLogForms_free_and_deRhamD_mem`: the bases above, on every affine
  open of the chart, and the stability of the logarithmic forms and their twist under `d`.

## Implementation notes

The sheaves are those of `MMP.Mori.Divisor.relativeLogForms`, described by their sections
inside `j_*Ω^p_{U/S}`; forms of all degrees are compared in the total graded ring
`Stacks.GradedAlgebra.Total` of `Ω^•_{U/S}`, whose multiplication is the wedge product. The
form `dtᵢ/tᵢ` is written `sᵢ · dtᵢ` for the inverse `sᵢ` of `tᵢ|_U`, which exists because `tᵢ`
vanishes only on `D`. Freeness on `W` is stated as: on every affine open `W' ⊆ W`, the map
sending a family of coefficients `c_K ∈ Γ(X, W')`, `K` a `p`-element subset of `{1, …, n}`, to
`∑_K c_K θ_K` is injective, and its image on coefficients in `I(W')` is the set of sections of
`I · Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` over `W'`. The rank `n.choose p` is the cardinality of the index type.

## References

* [J. Kollár, S. Mori, *Birational geometry of algebraic varieties*][KollarMori]
-/

open CategoryTheory AlgebraicGeometry TopologicalSpace Opposite

namespace MMP.Mori.Divisor

/-- **Relative logarithmic forms are locally free and closed under `d`.** The relative de Rham
differential maps `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` into `Ω^{p+1}_{X/S}(log D)` and `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D)` into
`Ω^{p+1}_{X/S}(log D)(-D)`, over every open of `X`. Moreover, let `W` be an affine
chart of the relative snc divisor `D` with coordinates `t : Fin n → Γ(X, W)`, the first `r` of
which are local equations of distinct components of `D`, with `t₁ ⋯ t_r` generating the ideal
of the support of `D` on `W`, and let `sᵢ` be the inverse of `tᵢ|_U` on `U ∩ W`. Put
`θᵢ = sᵢ · dtᵢ` (`= dtᵢ/tᵢ`) for `i < r` and `θᵢ = dtᵢ` otherwise. Then for every `p` and every
affine open `W' ⊆ W`, the wedges `θ_K`, `K` a `p`-element subset, form a basis of the sections
of `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)` over `W'`: the coefficient map is injective and, for every ideal sheaf
`I`, a section lies in `relativeLogForms n f D hD I p W'` iff it is `∑_K c_K θ_K` with all
`c_K ∈ I(W')`. The products `(t₁ ⋯ t_r) θ_K` form a basis of `Ω^p_{X/S}(log D)(-D)` over `W'`.
-/
@[mmp "lem_mmp_relative_log_forms_basis"]
public theorem relativeLogForms_free_and_deRhamD_mem (n : ℕ) {X S : Scheme.{u}} (f : X ⟶ S)
    [SmoothOfRelativeDimension n f] (D : Divisor X) (hD : D.IsRelativeSNC n f) :
    letI U : X.Opens := D.supp.compl
    (∀ (p : ℕ) (W : X.Opens) ω,
      (ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD ⊤ p W →
        ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (U.ι ≫ f)).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op (U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ W)) ω ∈
          relativeLogForms n f D hD ⊤ ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ) W) ∧
      (ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal p W →
        ((Scheme.Hom.deRhamComplex (U.ι ≫ f)).d p (p + 1)).val.app (op (U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ W)) ω ∈
          relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal ((p + 1 : ℕ) : ℤ) W)) ∧
    ∀ (x : X) (W : X.affineOpens) (V : S.affineOpens) (e : (W : X.Opens) ≤ f ⁻¹ᵁ (V : S.Opens))
      (t : Fin n → Γ(X, W)) (_hx : x ∈ (W : X.Opens))
      (_hb : letI := (f.appLE V W e).hom.toAlgebra
        ∃ b : Module.Basis (Fin n) Γ(X, W) Ω[Γ(X, W)⁄Γ(S, V)],
          ∀ i, b i = KaehlerDifferential.D Γ(S, V) Γ(X, W) (t i))
      (r : ℕ) (hr : r ≤ n) (j : Fin r → PrimeDivisor X) (_hj : Function.Injective j)
      (_hjD : ∀ i, j i ∈ D.support ∧ x ∈ (j i).support ∧
        (j i).idealSheaf.ideal W = Ideal.span {t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
      (_hDW : D.suppIdeal.ideal W = Ideal.span {∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i)})
      (s : Fin r → Γ(U.toScheme, U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W : X.Opens)))
      (_hs : ∀ i, s i * U.ι.app W (t (Fin.castLE hr i)) = 1),
      letI A := Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentialFormsAlgebra (U.ι ≫ f)
      letI B := A.toPresheafGradedAlgebra
      letI d : ∀ V : U.toScheme.Opens, Γ(U.toScheme, V) → (A.piece 1).val.obj (op V) :=
        fun V a =>
          (Scheme.Modules.exteriorGenerator (Scheme.Hom.relativeDifferentials (U.ι ≫ f))).val.app
            (op V) ((Scheme.Hom.universalRelativeDerivation (U.ι ≫ f)).d (X := op V) a)
      letI θ : Fin n → B.Total (op (U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W : X.Opens))) := fun i =>
        if h : (i : ℕ) < r then
          B.structureMap _ (s ⟨i, h⟩) * B.incl 1 (d _ (U.ι.app W (t i)))
        else B.incl 1 (d _ (U.ι.app W (t i)))
      ∀ (p : ℕ) (W' : X.affineOpens) (hW' : (W' : X.Opens) ≤ W),
        letI res : Γ(X, W') →+* Γ(U.toScheme, U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens)) := (U.ι.app W').hom
        letI combo : ({K : Finset (Fin n) // K.card = p} → Γ(X, W')) →
            B.Total (op (U.ι ⁻¹ᵁ (W' : X.Opens))) := fun c =>
          ∑ K, B.structureMap _ (res (c K)) *
            ((K.1.sort (· ≤ ·)).map fun i =>
              B.totalRestrict ((Opens.map U.ι.base).map (homOfLE hW')).op (θ i)).prod
        letI h : Γ(X, W') := X.presheaf.map (homOfLE hW').op (∏ i, t (Fin.castLE hr i))
        Function.Injective combo ∧
        (∀ (I : X.IdealSheafData) ω, ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD I p W' ↔
          ∃ c, (∀ K, c K ∈ I.ideal W') ∧ B.incl (p : ℤ) ω = combo c) ∧
        Function.Injective (fun c => combo (h • c)) ∧
        (∀ ω, ω ∈ relativeLogForms n f D hD D.suppIdeal p W' ↔
          ∃ c, B.incl (p : ℤ) ω = combo (h • c)) :=
  open MmpRelativeLogFormsBasisProof in
  ⟨fun p W'' ω => ⟨deRham_mem_relativeLogForms_top f D n hD p W'' ω,
      deRham_mem_relativeLogForms_suppIdeal f D n hD p W'' ω⟩,
    fun x W V e t _ hb r hr j _ hjD hDW s hs p W' hW' => relativeLogForms_basis_of_le D hD e hb
      hr j (fun i => ⟨(hjD i).1, (hjD i).2.2⟩) hDW hs p hW' _
      fun i => totalRestrict_θ0 f D t s hW' i⟩

end MMP.Mori.Divisor

end
